<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Mbembe Okohm [MFNOk]</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nnwẹr kw'ottong afa kwa Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nnwẹr kw'ottong afa kwa Samwẹl</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nnwẹr kw'ottong afa kwa Samwẹl</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọbhaang obo kwa Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />K'ogbe kwa Saul ọkk'ọpa, Devid obina kẹ da okk'anọng p'Amalẹk okhema okhuna, okwu owobha iwu ifa ka Ziklag. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Ottong iwu ittaan, ojinọng wani kw'ofon k'ibhingabe sa Saul okwu, ttara ọbara f'ọkk'ẹ ọjaakhi ka for, ọmaana ọkpọhm k'eho. Mada opyiri k'ibe sa Devid owobh, otto okhubha m'irerek k'ikpokpobha.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Devid e, ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Kọ afon man akwu ma o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Ojinọng nwa obhina bi, “Kaam nnọbhi k'ibhingabe s'agbong-nọng p'Israẹl e.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Devid ọbọbh bi, “Bọng odik wọ otto? Gbaakh-m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Ojinọng nwa obhina bi, “Asoja haabhada p'Israẹl arọbhi k'egbong-dam, haabhada abira ape. Saul ọmaana nnwa kwẹ Jonatan akk'abira apa e.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ọbọbh odikkobh nwa kw'otzim ẹkkaabha nda okwu bi, “Kọ areng yan aronga bi, Saul ọmaana nnwa kwẹ Jonatan akk'apa?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Odikkobh nwa oben bi, “Odik ode bi, kaam nda k'egbegbeho cha Gilboa, nna nda nttema da Saul on-otto ọkpẹkhi ọkhọhn fẹ, ttara bi, akpaar pa nnyanyaang mmindọr, ọmaana ayaari-nnyanyaang am-akhubh-ẹ ẹkhọma-ẹkhọma. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Mada ọbhakhi ore-m, oyer-m, nkhera mben bi, ‘Kkeri kaam ma e.’<verse eid="2SA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />“Ọbọbh-m bi, ‘Kọ ade bọng ọnọng o?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">“Kaam e, mmina bi, ‘Kaam mfon Amalẹk e.’<verse eid="2SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />“Mẹ wọ, oben-m bi, ‘Rọkhi abaang-m, afhu-m! Kaam nna nwobh ka mbọhk s'obo, yina, ndimi nji iwọhng ka e.’<verse eid="2SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />“Mẹ wọ, mbẹ-ẹ m'ẹbhabhaanga, mfhẹ-ẹ, okhuri da nne bi, mada ọkk'ọtta mẹ, akpen dọk kofha oruk. Nnwọr-ẹ ivaarkpo s'ọfọr k'eho, ọmaana ogimma kw'okhe k'ọbọhk. Nkk'pyẹ ndima nkwu ma bi, nnang kọ itta kwaam e.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ọmaana ajinọng pẹ biphyir abọkha ọbara fa bẹ afọr ka for ajaakhi. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Bẹ awobha ka nkwu-osisi, abira abhom amọng, atzim ọchattọhk maa, ẹchọhkha etto. Wa bẹ asi mando, okhuri obo kwa Saul ope ọmaana nnwa kwẹ Jonatan, ọmaana agbong-nọng p'anọng p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ttara anọng p'Israẹl, okhuri bi, bẹ atzim ọkkangkkaang afhu bẹ.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Devid e, ọbọbh odikkobh nwuma kw'otzim ẹkkaabha nda okwu bi, “Kọ afon man o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Ojinọng nwuma obhina bi, “Kaam nde nnwa kw'okhekhen-nọng kw'ofon Amalẹk.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Osi yan kw'ira on-ojor bi, ayaangi ọbọhk kwọ, afhu ọnọng kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'ana obyengi k'eho?”<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Mẹ wọ, Devid oyeri ojinọng kwẹ wani, oben bi, “Rọhng, atza afhẹ-ẹ!” Ofona mẹ, obun-ẹ ofhu, ojinọng nwuma ope. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Ode cha Devid ọkk'ẹ obena bi, “Izi sọ ibhaakhi ikpan kọ ọkhaam. Da akk'ẹmma chọ atzima asi ẹjaakhi bi, ‘Kaam nkk'ọnọng kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'ana obyengi k'eho mfha e.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebomọng cha Devid ọkkọhni k'obo kwa Saul ọmaana Jonatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Devid ọkkọhni ebomọng nda otzima ojima Saul ọmaana nnwa kwẹ Jonatan. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Obiro ọnang ẹfa bi, bẹ akpebhi ajinọng pa Juda ebomọng nda ch'oyuk. (Bẹ akkẹri ẹmọng nda ka nnwẹr kwa Jasha).<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Israẹl o, ajibhada pọ ape ayima ka mgbegbeho sọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Kpebh e, kkeri odem kw'afanọng atto e!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />“Bọng odik nwa ka Gat kàgbaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">Bọng kwẹ ka mkpaanga-den s'Ashkẹlọn kàgbaak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">oni mando ode, aminava p'anọng pa Philistiya, awobha k'ọdadaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">oni mando ode, aminava p'anọng p'ani ọkpakkọrikkọ asi, awobha k'ọdadaami.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Mgbegbeho sa Gilboa o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">bọng abonisi obiro ode ẹrọng, káre e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">Kaambi k'iwoni rọ, achimọma pa nnanga káwọm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">okhuri bi, mẹ wọ kwa bẹ alukhi ọkhọhnkpa kw'afanọng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">bẹ ọkhọhnkpa kwa Saul ana dọk kabọhr.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Ofon k'izi s'anọng pa ape,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">ofona k'ayaara p'afanọng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">oyuk kwa Jonatan nnama-nnam kọkpa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">Ọkkangkkaang kwa Saul nnam k'idukhi kobiro ọkpa.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />“Mada iwa Saul ọmaana Jonatan arukhi akpen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">bẹ akhaam idadaakha, abira asi ọphyaam anang ayok;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">k'obo, bẹ ayok kabira abhaangi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Wa bẹ aphyebhi ayọhnga okye-nọhn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">bẹ akhaama ẹfa ayọhnga nkye.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />“Aminava p'Israẹl o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">bọng mom Saul e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">kw'ọnangi bọng ọbara fa for f'ode iho-iho, ọmaana agimma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">kw'odok nnya sabọng ttara ẹfanginẹ-kpo pya gol.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />“Kpebh e! Kkeri odem kw'afanọng akk'atta k'egbong e!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Jonatan ope oyima ka mgbegbeho sọ.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Jonatan ọgbaanọkka kwaam o, kaam mmomi kọ e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">kọ wa abar-m odik kpọng-kpọng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Idadaakha s'iwa akhaam ttar-m ikkoni-okkoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">ikkoni ọtzam iyọhnga idadaakha sa kwanọng.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Kkeri odem kw'afanọng akk'atta!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Egbongkpo ekk'ekhibhi biphyir-phyir!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bẹ abyengi Devid ana k'eho ode ọvaarnọng kwa Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Okwu opyiri k'ogbe mẹ, Devid ọdọhn Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ọbọbh bi, “Na kaam mfha mvura k'obhon wani kw'ẹkhọma cha Juda o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obhin-ẹ bi, “Rọhng atza avura.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Devid ọbọbh bi, “Nchina ka bọng okhubha o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obhin-ẹ bi, “China ka Hẹbrọn.”<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ochina ka Hẹbrọn ttara panọng pẹ afa p'ade, Ahinoam kw'ofon Jẹzrẹl ọmaana Abigẹl, kw'ode opopa kwanọng kwa Nabal kw'ofon Kaamẹl. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Iwa Devid obiro otzima ajinọng p'awobh ttar-ẹ, ọnọng-ọnọng ttara ẹhọhmmọr chẹ, bẹ atza aruk k'ibhon sa Hẹbrọn. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Wa ajinọng pa Juda abina akwu ka Hẹbrọn, mẹ wọ kwa bẹ abyengi Devid ana k'eho, on-ode ọvaarnọng kwa Juda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Mada bẹ agbaakhi Devid bi, ajinọng pa Jabẹsh-Gilead bọ anọhng Saul, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />mando kwa Devid ọtzọhmi akkaabh-nkkaabha, atza agbaak ajinọng pa Jabẹsh-Gilead bi, “Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi odo bọng k'ọphyaam fa bọng asi anang itta kwabọng Saul, da bọng anọhng-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ọphyaam ọnang bọng, obiro ọkhọhkha bọng idadaakha, kaam mbiri nsi ọphyaam nnang bọng, okhuri odik nwa kwa bọng akk'asa. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Mẹ wọ, bọng gaangi for, ade ajinọng <char style="it">bi gbuk </char> da Saul kw'ode itta kwabọng ọkk'ọpa e. Kẹ wọ osi, ajinọng pa Juda akk'aam ana abyengi k'eho bi, nde ọvaarnọng kwabẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Egbong ch'anọng pa Devid ọmaana va pa va pa Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Ayongi mẹ, nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Nẹr, kw'okpen Abnẹr kw'ode oho kw'agbong-nọng pa Saul, okk'Ish-Boshẹt kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Saul, otzima ojekha ka Mahanayim. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Ọsẹ-ẹ ọvaarnọng kw'anọng pa Gilead, ọmaana Ashur, ọmaana Jẹzrẹl, ọmaana Ephraim, ọmaana Bẹnjamin ttara Israẹl biphyir.<verse eid="2SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Wa Ish-Boshẹt kw'ode nnwa kwa Saul, ode cho arọbh afa, mada ode ọvaarnọng kw'Israẹl, ọdabh bẹ ka cho afa. Yina, wa ẹkhọma cha Juda ẹtzọn Devid abẹ. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Wa Devid orukhi ka Hẹbrọn, ode ọvaarnọng kw'anọng pa Juda, ka cho azenamfa ọmaana aphe azadani.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abnẹr kw'ode nnwa kwa Nẹr, ọmaana ajinọng p'Ish-Boshẹt kw'ode nnwa kwa Saul, abina ka Mahanayim achina ka Gibeọn. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Wa Joab nnwa kwa Zeruya, ọmaana ajinọng pa Devid atza attema ayok abẹ k'esipe cha Gibeọn. Ẹkhaan dani ewobh ẹwọr k'okhubha wani kw'esipe, ẹkhaan ndonggo ewobha ẹwọr k'okhubha nwonggo.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Mẹ wọ e, Abnẹr oben Joab bi, “Tte m'otzekha adikkobh paman bani, bẹ atzima mbọhk-mbọhk arima ayok abẹ ma man k'itzitzikha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Joab e, oben bi, “Ojibhi kẹ! Tte bẹ arima.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Mando kwa bẹ atzek ajinọng jobh obhiri afa pa Bẹnjamin ọmaana Ish-Boshẹt nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Saul. Bẹ abira atzekha ajinọng jobh obhiri afa pa Devid. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Mẹ wọ, ojinọng kpenamkpen ọdabh oyok m'eho, okhum-ẹ ọkkangkkaang m'abhọribom, bẹ atto m'irerek ape. Ofona mẹ, bẹ ayeri ibe nnuma ka Gibeọn, Helkat-Hazurim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Helkat-Hazurim</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Odem kw'ọwọhng nwa oyini k'eHiburu bi mkpaar kọttaani. Yina, anwẹr bani abeni bi, ofha oyin irek s'amamaana, obiro ofha oyin irek s'ẹkhọhr. </char></note><verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Iwa egbong ẹgaangi m'ewu nduma maa, ajinọng pa Devid akhema ajinọng p'Abnẹr ọmaana ajinọng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Iwa va attaan pa Zeruya awobh mẹ p'ade: Joab, ọmaana Abishayi, ọmaana Asahẹl. Wa Asahẹl ode ọnọng kw'okpo ẹbhar mach'otzen-wuri k'ẹtzam. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asahẹl okhubh Abnẹr, nnam kọbhakhi bi okkeri k'odimbọhk, ọmaana kwabọhk. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abnẹr ọbhakhi nnam ọbọbh bi, “Asahẹl kọ wọ mẹ o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Asahẹl obhina bi, “O o kaam wọ e.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Abnẹr oben-ẹ bi, “Kkeri k'odimbọhk abira akkeri ka kwabọhk kwọ, abọkha odikkobh wani egbongkpo pyẹ ana.” Kaambi mẹ wọ, Asahẹl kokher bi ọkwọbh-ẹ okhukhubh.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abnẹr obiro oben Asahẹl bi, “Kwọbh-m okhukhubh! Okhuri yan kwa kaam mfhọ-ọ o mmari m'irerek? Yan kwa kaam nkkeri agbaanakka Joab k'itzitzikha o?”<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Yina, Asahẹl kokher bi ọkwọbha Abnẹr okhukhubh. Ofona mẹ, Abnẹr otzima ẹkhọhnma chẹ okhum Asahẹl k'ẹbhọr maa, ọkhọhn oyin ka nnam. Asahẹl otto m'ẹbaa ope. Ojinọng kpenamkpen kw'opyiri m'ibe s'Asahẹl oyim ope, obe mẹ k'ikpokpobha.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Yina, Joab ọmaana Abishayi akhubh Abnẹr, mada ewuchen ẹm-ẹkhakha, bẹ apyiri k'egbegbeho ch'Ama, ọbaanga Giya, k'ọkkadeden kw'ochin k'ibe s'anọng anarukhi sa Gibeọn. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Mẹ wọ, ajinọng p'ẹkhọma cha Bẹnjamin abe Abnẹr ka nnam. Bẹ atzobha k'ẹkhaan dani, atza abe k'egbegbeho-ebira, ado for s'egbong.<verse eid="2SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Mando kw'Abnẹr, oyeri Joab, oben bi, “Ode bi ọkkangkkaang ochina ororo ofhu anọng maa, ogbe ode o? Kọ katzini bi, okpong kw'odik nwa, otzima ọmmamma okwu o? Ogbe obhir otzuma yan, yina aben ajinọng pọ akwọbha vọkka pabẹ okhukhubh o?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Joab obhina bi, “Odem nwa kw'Ibinọkpaabyi orukhi akpen, idikha ira ani ẹmọng asi, ira bi, ajinọng mba achina ororo akhubh vọkka pabẹ maa, ewu ehobha.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Ofona mẹ e, Joab ogyi obukpọhng, otzima oyeri ajinọng pẹ biphyir, bẹ akwọbha anọng p'Israẹl okhukhubh, bẹ abira akwọbha erima.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />M'erungiwu nduma biphyir, Abnẹr ọmaana ajinọng pẹ asi orenga akwọbha Araba, bẹ ajekha Ẹttẹri cha Jọrdan, achina ororo m'ekpebhawu nduma biphyir, akwọbha obhon kwa Bitrọn akwu apyiri ka Mahanayim.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Mẹ wọ, Joab ọkpa nnam okhuna kẹ da okhubhi Abnẹr, obiro otzobha ajinọng pẹ biphyir. Oyongi Asahẹl, ajinọng ọhawani kw'ẹrọbh pa Devid bọ ani nnam akpa. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Yina, wa ajinọng pa Devid, akk'ajinọng pa Bẹnjamin, anọng arọbh chi obhiri arọbh attaan, p'atzọni Abnẹr abẹ afha. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Iwa bẹ atzọkha Asahẹl anọhnga k'epekhubh ch'otte kwẹ, ka Bẹtẹlẹhẹm. Mẹ wọ e, Joab ọmaana ajinọng pẹ atzima erungi nduma biphyir asi orenga maa, bẹ apyiri ka Hẹbrọn k'owuhobha.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Iwa egbong cha va pa va pa Saul ttara anọng pa Devid, ewobh k'ogbe-bhirada. Wa anọng pa Devid an-ado ẹfa akhaama, yina, ẹfa echina ororo ẹha va pa va pa Saul.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Iwa bẹ amaan va p'ijinọng anang Devid mada orukhi ka Hẹbrọn.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:2">Wa ocheden-nwa okpen Amnọn kw'Ahinoam kw'ofon Jẹzrẹl ọmaani;<verse eid="2SA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />ottong afa okpena Kilẹab kw'Abigẹl, kw'ode opopa kwa Nabal kw'ofon Kaamẹl ọmaani.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:3">Ottong attaan okpena Absalọm kw'ode nnwa kwa Maaka ọmaani. Wa Maaka ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kwa Talmayi kw'ode ọvaarnọng kwa Geshur.<verse eid="2SA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Ottong anna okpena Adonija kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Hagit;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:4">ottong azen okpena Shẹphatiya kw'ode nnwa kw'Abital.<verse eid="2SA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />Ottong azadani okpena Itreyam kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kw'Ẹgla ọmaani ọnang Devid.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:5">Va mba bọ p'iwa bẹ amaani anang Devid k'obhon kwa Hẹbrọn.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abnẹr ojek otzor Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />K'ogbe kwa va pa va pa Saul ọmaana anọng pa Devid atzima arim egbong, Abnẹr om-otzima ogbe nwuma odo for sẹ ẹfa okhe, k'ottem kwa va pa va pa Saul. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />M'ogbe nwa, Saul ọkk'ọkkọra-kwanọng ọkhaama kw'okpen Rizpa, kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kw'Aiya. Wa Ish-Boshẹt oben Abnẹr bi, “Okhuri yan kw'ayim ọkkọra-kwanọng kw'otte kwaam abẹ o?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Iwa ettem epyibh Abnẹr, okhuri odik kw'Ish-Boshẹt ọgbaakhi. Mẹ wọ, obhina bi, “Kaam nde oho kw'ẹpfa ch'esi ọtzọhm ẹnang anọng pa Juda ra a? Mayina, kaam nhak eho nnang atte Saul, ọmaana efona chẹ, ttara ayokh-ẹkhaan pẹ. Kaam kọ ọbọhk ndim mintta nnang Devid. Yina, kọ abar ettem abubh-m odik mayina, kw'okhuri kwanọng nwa. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Tte Ibinọkpaabyi osi-m k'eden kpenamkpen ch'ẹdaakh-ẹ, idikha kaam nni ọttọhk f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ochekhi ttara ọnwọhngi ọnang Devid, nsi. <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Ibinọkpaabyi obeni bi, ọtzọkha ẹvaar ch'ọhọhm kwa Saul ọnang Devid, on-ottima ẹvaarchi cha Devid aranga k'Israẹl ọmaana Juda, ttẹwọr ka Dan maa apyiri ka Beershẹba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Wa Ish-Boshẹt dọk koyom bi, ọgbaak atzim adọdọk ọnang Abnẹr, da Abnẹr ojor-ẹ.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Mẹ wọ, wa Abnẹr ọtzọhm akkaabh-nkkaabha bẹ atza abọbh Devid bi, “Irerek s'anyi rọ ma o? Kọ si echekhi ttara kaam, ifha kaam ndima ebhonmọr ch'Israẹl biphyir njekha ndor-ọ.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Devid obhina bi, “Ojibhi kẹ, kaam ńsi echekhi osi ttar-ọ. Yina, tte mphyem-ọ odik wani, kọ kaam k'itzitzikha kabe kw'oyongi bi, atzim Mikal kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kwa Saul, mada akwu bi akwu are-m.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ọtzọhm akkaabh-nkkaabha k'Ish-Boshẹt kw'ode nnwa kwa Saul, oben bi, “Bọng nang-m kwanọng kwaam kwa kaam ndim mkpatzọr arọbh azen s'aPhilistiya ndọkha.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Mando kw'Ish-Boshẹt ọnang ẹfa, bẹ arọbha Mikal k'ọbada kwa Paltiyẹl kw'ode nnwa kwa Laish, atzima afona. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Odim om-obhom ẹmọng ọtzọn-ẹ abẹ maa opyiri k'obhon kwa Bahurim. Mẹ wọ, Abnẹr oben-ẹ bi, “Kọ kpa nnam abhana!” Iwa ọkpa nnam ọbhana.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Iwa Abnẹr agbaak atzim ttara adenho p'Israẹl, oben bi, “K'ogbe kw'ọkk'ọkwọbha, bọng akk'am-akhonga bi, asi Devid ọvaarnọng. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Ogbe okk'on-obenga e, bọng na si mando! Da iwa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ochekhi ọnang Devid bi, ‘Kaam ńnenga k'ọtzọhmnọng kwaam Devid nkkaana anọng paam p'Israẹl ka mbọhk s'anọng pa Philistiya, ọmaana ka mbọhk s'attattaanga-nọng pabẹ biphyir.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abnẹr obiro ọgbaak atzim ọnang anọng pa Bẹnjamin. Mẹ wọ, obina ochina ka Hẹbrọn bi, ọtza ọgbaak Devid odik kpenamkpen kw'ojibh-ojibh k'itzitzikha s'anọng p'Israẹl, ọmaana ẹkhọma cha Bẹnjamin echibhi bi, esi. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Mada Abnẹr otzim ajinọng ẹrọbh okwu okhebha Devid ka Hẹbrọn, Devid osi ọdadaami otzima ọtzaam Abnẹr ọmaana ajinọng pẹ. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Mẹ wọ, Abnẹr oben Devid bi, “Tte kaam mfona madẹdẹn ifha nda ndobha anọng p'Israẹl biphyir nhok itta kwaam, kw'ode ọvaarnọng, ifha bẹ asi echekhi ttar-ọ. Kọ ábira ade ọvaarnọng kw'ọdabh kpenamkpen mach'ochibhi kwọ ode.” Mẹ wọ, wa Devid oben Abnẹr ọbhana k'odidiri.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Joab ofhu Abnẹr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Mẹ ẹba mẹ, ajinọng pa Devid ọmaana Joab afona k'egbong ttara ọgbọm-barada fa bẹ achi. Yina, wa Abnẹr ka Hẹbrọn ttara Devid dọk kowobh, da Devid okk'ẹ ọtzọhma ọbhana k'odidiri. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Mada Joab ọmaana agbong-nọng pẹ biphyir apyiri, bẹ agbaakh-ẹ bi, Abnẹr kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Nẹr ọkk'ọkwa m'ọvaarnọng, ttara bi, ọvaarnọng okk'ẹ ọtzọhma ọbhana k'odidiri e.<verse eid="2SA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Mẹ wọ e, Joab ofona ọtza okhebha ọvaarnọng ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Bọng odik kw'asi ma? Mmaang bi, ira Abnẹr okwu ma, okhuri yan kw'attẹ-ẹ ọbọhk ofona? Ma okk'ofona! <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Kọ arong ọnọng-dema kw'Abnẹr kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Nẹr ode kẹ. Kẹ okwu bi, okwu ọbọhr-ọ, ifha oronga orenga kwọ, obiro oronga odik kpenamkpen kw'am-asi.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Joab e, obina oji Devid, ọtzọhm akkaabh-nkkaabha akhubh Abnẹr ka nnam, bẹ abọkh-ẹ k'esipe cha Sira atzim-ẹ akpa nnam. Yina, iwa Devid odik nwa korong. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Mẹ wọ e, mada Abnẹr ọkpa nnam ka Hẹbrọn, Joab otzim-ẹ ọpaangi k'ottem kw'ẹbaakhamma, osi mach'oben bi ọgbaakh-ẹ atzim k'idafa. Mando kwa Joab okhum-ẹ imaana k'ẹbhọr ope, otzima otzukha obo kw'ọgbaanọkka kwẹ, Asahẹl.<verse eid="2SA 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Mada Devid ọbhaang odik nwa, oben bi, “K'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, mbọhk saam ttara s'anọng p'ọvaarbhon kwaam, m'odik kw'okhuri obo kw'Abnẹr, kw'ode nnwa kwa Nẹr, kinde o. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Tte izi s'Abnẹr inana Joab ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr ch'otte kwẹ biphyir k'eho! Tte ẹhọhmmọr cha Joab eningi ọnọng kw'osi edem, ọmaana okkikkima, ode ọnọng kw'ọrẹkh-ọrekhi, obiro ode ọnọng kw'ope obo kw'ọkkangkkaang, obiro ode ọnọng kw'ọchattọhk owori, ewori.”<verse eid="2SA 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />(Wa Joab ọmaana ọgbaanọkka Abishayi afhu Abnẹr, okhuri da ọkk'ọgbaanọkka kwabẹ Asahẹl ọfha k'egbong ka Gibeọn).<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Mẹ wọ, Devid oben Joab ọmaana anọng biphyir p'atzọn-ẹ abẹ bi, “Bọng jaakhi ọbara fabọng afọr ka for, bọng an-afọra abara-bina awobha ka nkwu-osisi s'Abnẹr.” Ọvaar Devid ọkhaam otzor igbaang s'itzọhk epfura-kkọhbhi nnam. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Wa bẹ anọhnga Abnẹr ma Hẹbrọn, ọvaar Devid obhom ẹmọng k'ẹrọng m'epekhubh ch'Abnẹr. Anọng biphyir abira abhom.<verse eid="2SA 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Ọvaar Devid ọkkọhn ebomọng ọnang Abnẹr:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Ma, ọbaan kẹ bi Abnẹr ope mach'odidingi-nọng o?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Bẹ ndik katzim adabh-ọ mbọhk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">Bẹ kọ mgbakkọhbh ka mmo kakpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Kọ ape mach'ọnọng kw'ope ka mbọhk s'anọng-dama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Anọng abira abhom ẹmọng k'ẹrọng.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Mẹ wọ, bẹ biphyir akwu akhukhi Devid bi ochi ọchattọhk, da ewu etzim-ewobh, yina, wa Devid ọtzọkha ọnwọhngi oben bi, “Tte Ibinọkpaabyi osi-m k'eden kpenamkpen ch'ẹdaakh-ẹ, idikha kaam nchi brẹd obiro ode ọttọhk kpenamkpen, yina s'ẹchọhkha etto!”<verse eid="2SA 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Iwa anọng mba biphyir atzin odik nwa, kwẹ obiro ọdaam bẹ ettem. K'odik-ọkka, odik kpenamkpen kw'ọvaarnọng osi, ọdaam bẹ ettem. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Mẹ wọ, m'ewu nduma, anọng pa Juda biphyir ọmaana anọng p'Israẹl biphyir aronga bi, ọvaar Devid ọbọhk k'obo kw'Abnẹr, kw'ode nnwa kwa Nẹr, kọkhaam.<verse eid="2SA 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Mẹ wọ, ọvaarnọng oben ajinọng pẹ bi, “Ode bi, bọng karong bi nnwa kw'ọvaarnọng ọmaana ọfanọng kw'ideden wọ ope mayina m'Israẹl o? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Mayina, kaambi ode bi kaam wọ nde ọvaarnọng kwa bẹ abyengi ana k'eho, ẹfa ẹkk'aam ẹha. Va mba pa Zeruya akhaam ẹfa ayọhng-m e. Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ochora obibyanọng otzor k'ibibyadik sẹ!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Obo kw'Ish-Boshẹt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Mada Ish-Boshẹt kw'ode nnwa kwa Saul, ọbhaang bi Abnẹr okk'ọpa ka Hẹbrọn, ẹfa ẹhẹ-ẹ. Ebhonmọr ch'Israẹl biphyir ebire ewobha k'ojora. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Wa nnwa nwa kwa Saul ọkhaam va p'ijinọng afa p'iwa ade adenho p'agbong-nọng. Wa oyok wani okpen Baana, nwonggo okpena Rekab. Wa bẹ ade va pa Rimọn kw'ofon Berot k'ẹkhọma cha Bẹnjamin. Wa bẹ am-atzọkha Berot attara k'ibhon s'isi ẹkhọma cha Bẹnjamin, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />okhuri da iwa anọng pa Berot arọbhi achina ka Gitayim, aruk mẹ mach'akhekhen-nọng maa apyiri k'ewu cha mayina.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />(Iwa Jonatan kw'ode nnwa kwa Saul ọkhaam nnwa kw'ijinọng kw'ọrẹkh-ọrẹkhi. Wa nnwa nwa ode cho azen mada bẹ atzim ẹkkaabha ch'obo kwa Saul ọmaana Jonatan ka Jẹzrẹl akwu. Wa kwanọng kw'om-okker-ẹ, otzin-ẹ otzima ọrọbh. Yina, mada oduk bi otzim-ẹ ofona, nnwa nwa ọnaang-ẹ otto ọphyakhi mmo. Wa nnwa nwa okpen Mẹphiboshẹt).<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Mẹ wọ, Rekab ọmaana Baana p'ade va pa Rimọn kw'ofon ka Berot, abina achina k'ọhọhm kw'Ish-Boshẹt. Wa bẹ apyiri kẹ k'ọyakpattem, k'ogbe kw'Ish-Boshẹt oyim k'ibe s'okwokha ọwọhng. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Bẹ adim k'ọhọhm ẹtzaanga macha bẹ atza wit ọtzọtzọkha, bẹ akhum-ẹ imaana k'ẹbhọr afhẹ-ẹ. Rekab ọmaana ọgbaanọkka Baana arọbh afona. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Mada bẹ akk'k'ọhọhm adima, bẹ achina k'ẹmaanggọ ch'Ish-Boshẹt akhebh-ẹ k'ebin ch'oyim afhẹ-ẹ. Bẹ akpaar-ẹ eho, atzima chẹ arenga k'eden ch'Araba k'erungiwu nduma biphyir. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Bẹ atzima eho nda ch'Ish-Boshẹt achena Devid ka Hẹbrọn, aben ọvaarnọng bi, “Kkeri eho ch'Ish-Boshẹt ma, kw'ode nnwa kw'ọttattaanga-nọng kwọ Saul, kw'ọkhami bi, ọfhọ-ọ. Mayina, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'odik nwa otzukha ma Saul ọmaana va pa va pẹ, k'eho ch'itta kwaam, kw'ode ọvaarnọng.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Yina, Devid obhina Rekab ọmaana ọgbaanọkka Baana p'ade va pa Rimọn, kw'ofon Berot bi, “Mach'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi orukhi akpen, kw'ọkk'aam ọkkaana ka mbọhk sa dama-dama kpenamkpen. <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />K'ogbe kw'ọnọng wani okwu ọgbaakh-m bi, kker e, Saul okk'ọpa, ttara ochibhi bi ochen-m ẹkkaabha ọkkakka. Iwa kaam mbọkh-ẹ mfhu k'obhon kwa Ziklag. Echora ch'iwa kaam nnang-ẹ k'ẹkkaabha nduma dọ mẹ! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Ọn-ọyọhng ma da anọng-dama akk'ọnọng kw'oni oponga-pyibha ọkhaam, akhebha k'ọhọhm kwẹ afhu k'ebin. Ọbaan-ọbaana bi nnor izi sẹ, mbọbh bọng, mbiri ndimi bọng m'ọyagbin nwa!”<verse eid="2SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ọnang ajinọng pẹ ẹfa bi, bẹ afhu bẹ. Wa bẹ akpaara mbọhk ọmaana mmo sabẹ, bẹ agbana sẹ abaanga esipe ka Hẹbrọn. Yina, wa bẹ atzọkha eho ch'Ish-Boshẹt atza anọhnga k'epekhubh ch'Abnẹr ka Hẹbrọn.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ode ọvaarnọng kw'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Iwa ngọma s'Israẹl biphyir nkwu ngebha Devid ka Hẹbrọn mben bi, “K'odik-ọkka, kọ ade ofona-nọng kwaman, mode izi rani. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />K'ogbe kw'ọkk'ọkwọbha, iwa Saul ode ọvaarnọng kwaman, kọ wọ iwa ade ọnọng kw'om-otzima agbong-nọng p'Israẹl eden ka mgbong. Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ọ bi, ‘Kọ wọ áde ọnọng kw'okkeri anọng paam p'Israẹl, kọ ábira ade ọvaarnọng kwabẹ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Mada adeden-nọng biphyir p'Israẹl akk'ọvaar Devid akhebha ka Hẹbrọn, ọvaarnọng osi echekhi ọmaana bẹ m'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Wa bẹ abyengi Devid ana k'eho, asẹ-ẹ ọvaarnọng kw'Israẹl.<verse eid="2SA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Iwa Devid ode cho ẹrọbh obhiri jobh, mada ọdabhi ẹvaar. Wa ọdabhi ẹvaar ka cho arọbh afa. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Ka Hẹbrọn, Devid ọdabhi Juda ka cho azenamfa ọmaana aphe azadani, obiro ọdabh anọng biphyir p'Israẹl ọmaana pa Juda ka Jẹrusalẹm, ka cho ẹrọbh obhiri jobh obhiri attaan.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devid okhem anọng pa Jẹrusalẹm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Ọvaarnọng ọmaana ajinọng pẹ arenga achina ka Jẹrusalẹm bi, bẹ atza arima abaJẹbus p'iwa arukhi mẹ, abẹ. AbaJẹbus aben Devid bi, “Ma kádim, kaambi akpa-chechena ọmaana anọng p'arẹkh-ọrẹkhi bọ, bẹ afha okhubh-ọ okhubh.” Iwa bẹ achibhi bi, “Na bẹ afha akpa Devid eden.” <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Kaambi mẹ wọ, Devid ọbọkha ichubhabe sa Ziyọn, kw'ode odedenmon kwa Devid.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />M'ewu nduma, Devid okk'obena bi, “Ọnọng manda wani kw'ókhema abaJẹbus, ọkhaambi da órenga k'akhekhaho, yina okhebha ‘akpa-chechena, ọmaana anọng p'arẹkh-ọrẹkhi’ p'ade attattaanga-nọng pa Devid.” Kẹ wọ osi bẹ aben bi, “Akpa-chechena ọmaana anọng p'arẹkh-ọrẹkhi k'ẹvaar-ttọhmma kádim.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Devid ọbọkha ichubhabe nna obiro oruk mẹ, oyeri ibẹ nna Odedenmon kwa Devid. Iwa osi odedenmon nwa ọkhọri, ttẹwọr k'igbo maa apyiri k'ẹtzaanga. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Devid on-odo ẹfa ọkhaama okhuri da Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa biphyir owobh ttar-ẹ.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Mẹ wọ, Hiram kw'ode ọvaarnọng kwa Tyrẹ ọtzọhm akkaabh-nkkaabha ka Devid, p'ọnangi achi-khuma p'ọbhọhmi mancheni, ọmaana akarpẹnta ttara amuni-nchumi s'ihọhm bi, bẹ atza asi ẹvaar-ttọhmma anang Devid. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ofona mẹ, Devid otzin bi, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'ẹ araanga ottima mach'ọvaarnọng k'Israẹl, ọttara bi, okk'ọvaarbhon kwẹ abarada ọnanga okhuri anọng pẹ p'Israẹl.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Mada Devid obin ka Hẹbrọn, ọkhaam akkọra-panọng k'ọhaabh, ọmaana panọng p'ọtzọkh-ọtzọkha ka Jẹrusalẹm. Wa bẹ amaan-ẹ va p'ijinọng ọmaana p'ipanọng k'ọhaabh. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Ma wọ ode che pa va p'iwa obhoni ka Jẹrusalẹm: Shamua ọmaana Shobab, ọmaana Natan, ọmaana Sọlọmọn, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />ọmaana Ibha, ọmaana Elishua, ọmaana Nẹphẹg, ọmaana Japhiya, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />ọmaana Elishama, ọmaana Eliyada ttara Ẹliphẹlẹt.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devid okhem aPhilistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Mada aPhilistiya abhaang bi, bẹ akk'Devid ana abyengi k'eho asẹ-ẹ ọvaarnọng kw'Israẹl, bẹ abina k'ẹfa atza aror Devid bi, bẹ abọkha. Iwa Devid ọbhaanga kwẹ, obina ọhakha k'ichubhabe. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Mando kw'aPhilistiya akk'akwa akpẹ k'ẹttẹri cha Rephayim. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Mẹ wọ, wa Devid ọtza ọdọhn Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Nda ńnima aPhilistiya abẹ o? Na átte bẹ ọbọhk anang-m o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obhin-ẹ bi, “Kọ rọhng, k'odik-ọkka, kaam ńtte aPhilistiya ọbọhk otte nnang-ọ.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ofona ochina ka Baal-Pẹrazim, kẹ kw'obiro okhema bẹ. Wa oben bi, “Odem nwa kw'asi am-amaam, mando kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọmaam k'ibe s'attattaanga-nọng paam k'itzitzikha saam.” Ofona mẹ, oyeri ibe nnuma Baal-Pẹrazim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baal-Pẹrazim</char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'eHiburu oyini Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ọm-ọmaam k'ibe.</char></note>. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Iwa Devid ọmaana ajinọng pẹ atzini agbatza p'aPhilistiya arọbhi aji, atzima afona.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />APhilistiya abira ayin ka, atza akpẹ k'Ẹttẹri cha Rephayim. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Mẹ wọ e Devid obiro ọdọhn Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obhina bi, “Bọng bi gbẹng karenga avura, yina, bọng khọri bẹ ka nnam-annam akhe k'ottem. Bọng arima bẹ abẹ k'itzitzikha-itzitzikha kwa nchi sa balsam. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Bọng abhaang iyọkhi s'agbong-nọng am-arenga k'ebira kwa nchi sa balsam <char style="it">bi kpaar</char>, bọng jaabhi mmo, mẹ wọ oyini bi, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'bọng eden ọcha, ọtza orima agbong-nọng p'aPhilistiya abẹ k'ibhingabe.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Mẹ wọ, iwa Devid osi mach'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'ẹ ọtzọhna. Ofhu aPhilistiya tzọni ka Gibeọn maa apyiri ka Gẹzẹr.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bẹ atzim Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi achina ka Jẹrusalẹm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Iwa Devid obiro otzobha adikkobh p'Israẹl p'agaangi for, anọng nnọhna arọbh attaan obhiri chi. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Kẹ ọmaana ajinọng pẹ biphyir afona achina ka Baala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baala</char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'eHiburu obiro okpena Kiriyat Jerim. Ode odem wani ka 1Krọnikle 13:6.</char></note> k'ẹkhọma cha Juda bi, bẹ atza atzọkha Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi atzima akwu. Ẹkkọhbhi nda cha bẹ ayeri ka Che, kw'ode che ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa biphyir, kwa bẹ ahokhi ẹwọr k'ottem kw'achẹrubim, k'Ẹkkọhbhi nda ch'Echekhi. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Bẹ atzọkha Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi anana k'ọkpaar ọbhakwẹ kwa nnyanyaang mmindọr, atzima chẹ abina k'ọhọhm kw'Abinadab, kw'owobh k'egbegbeho. Uza ọmaana Ahiyo p'ade va p'Abinadab, bọ iwa am-atzima ọkpaar nwa ọbhakwẹ eden, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />ọmaana Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi ch'ẹnan k'egbegbeho, cha bẹ anan mẹ. Wa Ahiyo om-orenga k'itzitzikha s'ọkpaar nwa. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Iwa Devid ọmaana anọng p'Israẹl biphyir atzim ọkkọhna, ọmaana abukpọhng, ọmaana agim-agim, ọmaana agang-gaang, ọmaana achachaak, ọmaana ngorokpa p'echi ẹkkakka ttara achang-changkpa, am-asi ọdadaami ttara ẹfa chabẹ biphyir, k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Mada bẹ apyiri k'ibe sa bẹ am-awobha agwuma abarli-mọma sa Nakọn, Uza onemi ọbọhk ọbọkha Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi, da abhaam asar bi atto. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọdọkhi ettem otzima otzor Uza okhuri irẹrẹkhi sẹ. Mẹ wọ, Ibinọkpaabyi obun-ẹ ofhu, otto ọbaanga Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi, ope.<verse eid="2SA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Mẹ wọ, iwa Devid ọdọkh-ẹ okhuri idọdọkhi s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otzim otzor Uza. Tzọni kẹ maa apyiri k'ewu cha mayina, be ayeri ibe nnuma Pẹrẹz-Uza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pẹrẹz Uza</char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'eHiburu oyini ettuma ch'Uza.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />M'ewu nduma, Devid ọkhaama ojora f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, oben bi, “Yan wọ kw'Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi en-erenga etzor kaam o?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Iwa for kodo bi, ọtzọkha Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bi, ewobha ttar-ẹ k'odedenmon kwa Devid. Wa otzer ọpaangi chẹ ochina k'ọhọhm kw'Ọbẹd-Edom kw'ofon Git. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Wa Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ewobh k'ọhọhm kw'Ọbẹd-Edom kw'ofon Git k'aphe attaan. Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi odo Ọbẹd-Edom ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr chẹ biphyir.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Mẹ wọ, bẹ agbaak ọvaar Devid bi, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'ẹhọhmmọr ch'Ọbẹd-Edom ọda, ọmaana ọttọhk kpenamkpen fẹ, okhuri Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi e.” Wa Devid ofona ttara ọdadaami, ọtza ọtzọkha Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi k'ọhọhm kw'Ọbẹd-Edom, otzima okwu k'Odedenmon kwa Devid. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Mada anọng p'atzọhk Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi akk'ndọkhi nzadani arenga, Devid ọtzọkha ọbhaam-dim ọmaana ọbhaamnwa kw'ojibhi for otzima osi ẹjafọhni. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Wa Devid ọfọr ẹphọd om-otzima otzubh ebin ttara ẹfa chẹ biphyir k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />k'ogbe kwa Devid ọmaana anọng p'Israẹl biphyir atzim ọkkọhna, ọmaana abukpọhng am-atzima Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi akwu.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Mada bẹ am-atzima Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi anwa k'Odedenmon kwa Devid, Mikal kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kwa Saul, obe k'ọphapha-mma om-okkeri k'iyaan. Mada ore da Devid om-ogbe akhura, obiro otzubh ebin k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, Devid e, okpukhi Mikal idik.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Bẹ atzima Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi akwu attima k'ibe sa chẹ ẹbaan bi ewobha, k'ikhira sa Devid ọkk'ọsa ohok chẹ. Wa Devid osi njafọhni nkwọmisẹ ọmaana nnanga s'odidiri ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Mada Devid okk'njafọhni nkwọmisẹ ọmaana nnanga s'odidiri okyera osisi, on-odo anọng mba ka che ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa biphyir. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Ọtzọkha brẹd, ọmaana itzen-gbugbukhi, okwu ọttara k'ittukha s'agrep p'agwu-ogwu ọnang ọnọng-ọnọng, ajinọng ọmaana panọng m'ẹkhaan ch'anọng p'Israẹl biphyir. Wa anọng mba biphyir abhana k'ihọhm sabẹ.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Mada Devid okhun k'ọhọhm bi, okwu odo ẹhọhmmọr chẹ, Mikal kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kwa Saul oyin okhebh-ẹ k'iyaan, oben bi, “Mayina ọvaarnọng kw'Israẹl okk'for sẹ otzekha ohok ngọmi e. Okk'ikpakpa-dukhi otzima mach'odidingi-nọng k'itzitzikha s'abira-minava p'ade atzọhmnọng p'akhaan-nọng pẹ!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Devid oben Mikal bi, “Kaam nsi ọdadaami k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'okhiri atte ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr chẹ oji, k'ogbe kw'otzekh-m bi, nde ọvaarnọng kw'anọng p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi p'Israẹl. Kaam ńsi ọdadaami k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />O o! Kaam nkk'for nda bi ńdo odidingi-nọng ńger e, mbiri ńlukhi for saam nyọhnga ma. Yina, k'itzitzikha s'abira-minava mbuma p'ade atzọhmnọng p'agbaakhi odik okhuri, bẹ ánang-m ikpokpobha ọnang e.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Iwa Mikal, kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kwa Saul, nnwa kọmaani maa opyiri k'ewu ch'iwa ope.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi osi ọnang Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />K'ogbe mẹ, wa ọvaar Devid ọkk'ẹwọr ọbọkha k'ẹvaar-ttọhmma chẹ. Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkk'ẹ odidiri obiro ọnanga k'attattaanga-nọng pẹ biphyir, p'arukhi akhọr-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />Wa Devid oben Natan kw'ode ọsẹjaakhi kw'Ibinọkpaabyi bi, “Kker e, kaam nnukhi k'ẹvaar-ttọhmma ẹkkakka cha bẹ atzim nchi s'ọbhọhmi mancheni asi, k'ogbe kw'Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi ekpong k'ikhira.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Natan obhina ọvaarnọng bi, “China ororo asi odik kpenamkpen kw'ọpaan-ọ, kkeri Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi owobh mẹ ttar-ọ.”<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />M'erungiwu nduma, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Natan bi,<verse eid="2SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Rọhng atza agbaak ọtzọhmnọng kwaam Devid bi, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obeni bi, kọ rang ási ọhọhm kwa kaam ńnukh e. <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Kaam k'ọhọhm, ndimi nnukha ttẹwọr k'ewu cha kaam ndim anọng p'Israẹl mbina k'Ijip, maa apyiri k'ewu cha mayina. Kaam nkk'mminnukha k'obe-k'obe k'ikhira, mach'ọhọhm kwaam. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Wa kaam nnangi adabhi pa ngọma s'anọng p'Israẹl ẹfa bi, bẹ atzima anọng pabẹ eden mach'akkeri-arukhimaan atzim arukhimaan pabẹ eden. Kaam nkk'nnenga k'obe-k'obe ttara bẹ, mbiri mming k'obe-k'obe k'ikhira. Ogbe kode kwa kaam nkk'adabhi mba mbena bi, “Bẹ atzima ọbhọhmi mancheni asi ọhọhm anang-m.” ’<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Mẹ wọ, gbaak ọtzọhmnọng kwaam Devid bi, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa biphyir obeni bi, kaam ndọkh-ọ k'owoni kẹ da am-akkeri arukhimaan, nkwu nsọ-ọ ọdabhi kw'anọng paam, p'Israẹl. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kaam nkk'nwobha ttara kọ k'ibe kpenamkpen s'akk'atza, mbiri mfhu attattaanga-nọng p'am-arim-ọ abẹ biphyir. Mẹ wọ, kaam nna ńsọ-ọ atza che, macha che p'anọng p'atza che ọtzam k'ọyagbin. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Mẹ wọ, kaam ńnang anọng paam p'Israẹl ibe, mbiri nttima bẹ aranga, bẹ ákhaama oruk kw'ode kwabẹ, ifha bẹ aningi bẹ atzim dọk ayakhi. Anọng-dama bẹ, bẹ ihem dọk kánang, mach'iwa ode k'ittẹwọr, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />ọmaana k'ogbe kwa ndek asi-aponga p'anọng paam Israẹl. Kaam ḿbiri nsọ-ọ awobha k'odidiri ọmaana attattaanga-nọng pọ biphyir.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:11">“ ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ẹjaakhi bi, kẹ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ma for sẹ wọ óttima ẹhọhmmọr chọ aranga, ọnang kọ ọmaana va pa va pọ. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Mada iwu sọ íttonga m'ọyagbin bi, atza akwokha ọwọhng ttara abitta pọ, kaam ńnọbha nnwa wani k'ottem kwa va pọ, kw'óde izi sọ ọkhaam, ḿbiri nttima ọvaarbhon kwẹ aranga. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Kẹ wọ ósi ọhọhm ọnang-m ka che chaam. Kaam ḿbiri nttima ẹvaar ch'ọvaarbhon kwẹ aranga maa ogbe ode. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Kaam wọ ńde otte kwẹ, kẹ obiro óde nnwa kwaam. K'ogbe kw'osi epina, ńdima ẹyaangi-chi ch'anọngẹya nttum-ẹ, ḿbiri ndima mbọhk s'anọngẹya ḿmum-ẹ ekpo. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Yina, ọnọng kode kw'ọ́tzọkha idadaakha saam ka kẹ, mach'iwa ndọk sẹ ka Saul, kw'iwa nnọbh k'ẹvaar chẹ m'itzitzikha sọ. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Ọhọhm kwọ ọmaana ọvaarbhon kwọ óttima aranga m'ikhina ogbe ode.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Mẹ wọ, wa Natan ọgbaak Devid atzim p'ẹjaakhi nda biphyir.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Njọhm sa Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Iwa ọvaar Devid odim k'ẹtzaanga otza owobha ẹwọr k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ozi njọhm oben bi,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:18">“O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng, kaam nde macha bọng ọnọng o, ẹhọhmmọr chaam epe mbọng o, kw'atzin-m anana k'ebe-dema nda o? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Yina, ka chen pọ, kwẹ mẹ kokpong. Ọvaar kw'Ọyọhng, kọ akk'ẹjaakhi asa ch'ekhuri ẹvaar ch'ọtzọhmnọng kwọ k'ogbe ororo. O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng, ndọhna nna nde s'anọngẹya o?<verse eid="2SA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />“O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng, kọ arong kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ kẹ, bọng odik wọ kwa kaam Devid mbiri mgbaak nnang-ọ o? <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Kọ akk'odik-barada asa, abira asi ẹjaakhi anang kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ, okhuri atzim pọ ọmaana ochibhi kwọ.<verse eid="2SA 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />“O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng, ma kw'abar e! Ọnọng kw'ode mach-ọ kode, ọkha f'obeng kọ Ibinọkpaabyi abẹ kode, macha mokk'ọbhaanga. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Bọng anọng bọ ade mach'anọng pọ p'Israẹl o? Obhon manda wani kw'ode mach'obhon kw'Israẹl m'ọyagbin kode, kw'Ibinọkpaabyi ọtza obhek mach'anọng ọnang for sẹ bi, osi che ọnang for sẹ, obiro osi idik-barada s'ipe anọng for ọmaana ikkokkoni-dik bi, okhubh idibhon ọmaana akha pabẹ k'itzitzikha s'anọng pọ, pa abhekhi k'Ijip. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Kọ akk'anọng pọ p'Israẹl aranga attima mach'anọng pa kọ ọkhaam. Kọ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, akk'Ibinọkpaabyi kwabẹ abira akwa ada, maa ogbe ode.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Mẹ wọ, O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kọ hok echekhi cha akk'asa okhuri ọtzọhmnọng kwọ ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr chẹ, maa ogbe ode. Kọ si mach'akk'achekhi, <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />ifha kọ atza che maa ogbe ode. Mẹ wọ, anọng án-aben bi, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa biphyir wọ ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl!’ Ẹhọhmmọr ch'ọtzọhmnọng kwọ Devid éttima aranga k'itzitzikha sọ.<verse eid="2SA 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />“O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa biphyir, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, kọ akk'ẹjaakhi nda asa anang ọtzọhmnọng kwọ, aben bi, ‘Kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ńsi ọhọhm nnang-ọ.’ Mẹ wọ, ọtzọhmnọng kwọ okk'ottem-bara ọkhaama bi, ozi njọhm nna ọnang-ọ. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng, kọ wọ ade Ibinọkpaabyi! Echekhi chọ ede odik-ọkkakka. Kọ akk'idik nna abira achekhi anang ọtzọhmnọng kwọ. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Tte ettem ẹdaam-ọ bi, ẹdaa ch'ado va pa va paam échina ororo k'itzitzikha sọ, maa ogbe ode; da kọ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng akk'agbaakha. Ofona k'ẹdaa chọ, va pa va p'ọtzọhmnọng kwọ ákhaama ẹdaa maa ogbe.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ngema sa Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Okwu opyiri k'ogbe mẹ, Devid okhema anọng pa Philistiya, obiro ohok bẹ awobha k'irekh-irek kwẹ. Ọtzọkha obhon kwa Mẹtẹg-Ama ka mbọhk s'anọng pa Philistiya.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Wa Devid obiro okhema anọng pa Moab. Osi bẹ ayima k'irerek k'adik attaan, ọtzọkha adik afa ofhu, otte odik wani biphyir ọbọhk oruk akpen. Wa anọng pa Moab an-aruk k'irekh-irek kwa Devid, bẹ am-abira achen-ẹ nnduma.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Ayongi mẹ, wa Devid obiro okhema Hadadẹzẹr kw'ode ọvaarnọng kwa Zoba, obiro ode nnwa kwa Rehob. Wa okhem-ẹ k'ogbe kw'ọtza bi, obiro ọtza ottima ẹvaar chẹ aranga k'okhubha kw'Ọraanga kwa Yupharetes. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Wa Devid ọbọkha akpaar pa nnyanyaang mmindọr nnọhna mfa obhiri arọbh jobh, ọmaana ayaari-nnyanyaang nnọhna chi obhiri mfa obhiri arọbh jobh, ttara agbong-nọng nnọhna arọbh afa obhiri jobh. Wa Devid ọrẹkhi nnyanyaang sa mmindọr akpaar biphyir, kw'oyongi nnyanyaang s'akpaar arọbh azen s'irikhi.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Mada anọng p'Aram p'afon Damaskọs akwu bi akwu akkaana Hadadẹzẹr kw'ode ọvaarnọng kwa Zoba, wa Devid ofhu bẹ anọng nnọhna arọbh afa obhiri chi. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Wa obiro ohok agbong-nọng p'abaabh ẹbaakhamma ch'ẹkhọma ch'anọng p'Aram p'afon Damaskọs. Anọng p'Aram an-awobha k'irekh-irek kwẹ, bẹ abira achen-ẹ nnduma. Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnangi Devid ekhema k'ibe kpenamkpen s'ochin.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Wa Devid ọtzọkha akhọhnkpa pa gol p'akhaan-nọng pa Hadadẹzẹr, otzima okhuna ka Jẹrusalẹm. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Ttẹwọr ka Teba ọmaana Bẹrotayi p'ade ibhon sa Hadadẹzẹr. Wa ọvaar Devid ọtzọkha brons k'ọhaabh.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Mada Toi kw'ode ọvaarnọng kwa Hamat ọbhaang bi, Devid okk'agbong-nọng pa Hadadẹzẹr biphyir okhema, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />ọtzọhm nnwa kwẹ Joram bi, ọtza orima ọvaar Devid da okhem Hadadẹzẹr k'egbong, kw'okk'Toi abẹ om-orima. Wa Joram otzim nnanga sa silva ọmaana gol, ttara brons, otzima ọtza.<verse eid="2SA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Wa ọvaar Devid otte nnanga nna ọbọhk ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, mach'ọkk'ọsa ttara silva ọmaana gol p'iwa ọtzọk k'idibhon biphyir s'okk'okhema, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />sa nde ẹkhọma ch'Edom ọmaana Moab, ọmaana Ammọn, ọmaana Philistiya, ttara Amalẹk. Wa obiro otte ọgbọm f'ochi ka Hadadẹzẹr, kw'ode ọvaarnọng kwa Zoba kw'Aram, obiro ode nnwa kwa Rehob, otte ọbọhk ọnang Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Wa Devid obiro ọtza che da okhun egbong ch'orim ttara anọng p'Aram, ch'ofhu anọng p'Edom nnọhna arọbh afa obhiri nzen k'Ẹttẹri ch'Onung.<verse eid="2SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Wa ohok agbong-nọng p'abaabh mbaakhamma s'Edom makhọra, anọng p'Edom biphyir an-awobha irekh-irek kwa Devid. Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnangi Devid ekhema k'ibe kpenamkpen s'ochin.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akhaan-nọng pa Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Wa Devid ọdabhi Israẹl makhọra, om-obiro ọttọhna aponga p'atzor-otzor abira ajibh-ojibh ọnang anọng pẹ biphyir. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Wa Joab kw'ode nnwa kwa Zeruya wọ ode odenho kw'agbong-nọng; Jehoshaphat kw'ode nnwa kwa Ahilud ode ọkkẹri kw'idik sa ikk'itta. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Zadọk kw'ode nnwa kw'Ahitub ọmaana Ahimẹlẹk kw'ode nnwa kw'Abiyata, bọ wa ade afọhnẹja; Sẹraya ode ọkkẹri; <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Bẹnaya kw'ode nnwa kwa Jẹhoyada wọ ode odenho kw'anọng pa Kẹrẹt ọmaana anọng pa Pẹlẹt. Va pa Devid p'ijinọng ade afọhnẹja.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọmaana Mẹphiboshẹt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Iwa Devid ọbọbh bi, “Ọnọng manda wani otzim orikhi k'ẹhọhmmọr cha Saul, kwa kaam mfha nsi ọphyaam nnang k'eho cha Jonatan o?”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Wa ọkhaam ọtzọhmnọng kw'om-okkeri ẹhọhmmọr cha Saul kw'okpen Ziba, kw'iwa bẹ ayeri anang Devid. Ọvaar Devid ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Kọ wọ akpen Ziba o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Obhina bi, “O o, kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ wọ e.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Iwa ọvaarnọng ọbọbh bi, “Ọnọng manda wani otzim orikhi k'ẹhọhmmọr cha Saul, kwa kaam mfha nsi ọphyaam f'Ibinọkpaabyi nnang o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Ziba obhina ọvaarnọng bi, “Nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Jonatan otzim orikhi kẹ e, kẹ ọrẹkh-ọrẹkhi e.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Ọvaarnọng ọbọbh bi, “Owobh man?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Ziba obhina bi, “Kẹ owobh ka Lo-Debar ttara Makir, nnwa kw'ijinọng kw'Amiyẹl.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Mẹ wọ e, ọvaar Devid ọtzọhm bẹ ka Lo-Debar k'ọhọhm kwa Makir, k'ode nnwa kw'Amiyẹl bi, bẹ atza atzim-ẹ akwu.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Mada Mẹphiboshẹt kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Jonatan kwa Saul obhoni opyiri, ọrakha ọnang ọvaar Devid ikpokpobha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Devid oyer-ẹ bi, “Mẹphiboshẹt!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Obhina bi, “Itta kwaam, kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ wọ e.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Devid oben-ẹ bi, “Oning-ọ ojor, kaam ńsi ọphyaam nnang-ọ k'eho ch'atte Jonatan. Kaam ḿbiri mkpa nnam ndọkha irerek s'atte kw'ideden saul, biphyir ńnang-ọ, kọ am-abira achi ọchattọhk k'ọgbaakha kwaam ttara kaam, k'ogbe kpenamkpen.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mẹ wọ, Mẹphiboshẹt ọrakha k'ikpokpobha, oben bi, “Kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ nde mach'anyi o, kw'asi ọphyaam-dema mva anang inọng-dukhi macha kaam o?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Mẹ wọ, ọvaarnọng oyeri Ziba kw'ode ọtzọhmnọng kwa Saul, ọgbaakh-ẹ bi, “Kaam nkk'ọttọhk kpenamkpen fa Saul kw'ode itta kwọ ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr chẹ biphyir ọbọhk ntta nnang nnwa-mmona kw'itta kwọ. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Kọ ọmaana va pọ p'ijinọng, ọmaana atzọhmnọng pọ áyaabha owoni ánang-ẹ, ifha ọchattọhk owobha fa nnwa-mmona kw'itta kwọ óm-ochi. Mẹphiboshẹt kw'ode nnwa-mmona kw'itta kwọ óm-ochi ọchattọhk ttar-m k'okpokkoro kwaam.” (Wa Ziba ọkhaam va p'ijinọng chi, ttara atzọhmnọng ẹrọbh.)<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Iwa Ziba oben ọvaarnọng bi, “Ọtzọhmnọng kwọ ósi-osi mach'itta kwaam, kw'ode ọvaarnọng obeni.” Mẹ wọ, Mẹphiboshẹt ochi ọchattọhk k'okpokkoro ttara ọvaar Devid mach'ọvaar-nnwa kw'ijinọng.<verse eid="2SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Iwa Mẹphiboshẹt ọkhaam ijinọnọnga kw'okpen Mika. Wa anọng p'arukhi k'ẹhọhmmọr cha Ziba biphyir ade atzọhmnọng pa Mẹphiboshẹt. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Iwa Mẹphiboshẹt oruk ka Jẹrusalẹm; da iwa om-ochi ọchattọhk k'okpokkoro kw'ọvaarnọng. Iwa kẹ ọrẹkh-ọrẹkhi.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Devid okhem ab'Ammọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Okwu opyiri k'ogbe mẹ, ọvaarnọng kw'anọng p'Ammọn okwu opẹ, nnwa kwẹ kw'ijinọng kw'okpen Hanun ọn-ọdabh ẹvaar chẹ.<verse eid="2SA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Iwa Devid oben bẹ bi, “Kaam ńsi ọphyaam nnang Hanun kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Nahash, mach'iwa otte osi ọphyaam ọnang-m.” Mẹ wọ, Devid ọtzọhm anọng bi bẹ atza adini Hanun nttem k'obo kw'otte. Mada atzọhmnọng pa Devid apyiri k'irerek s'Ammọn, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />adenho p'Ammọn aben Hanun kw'ode itta kwabẹ bi, “Kọ achibhi bi ikpokpobha rọ sa Devid ọkhọk k'obo kw'atte yina ọtzọhm ajinọng mba bi, bẹ adin-ọ nttem o? Kwẹ mando kode e, ọtzọhmi bẹ bi, bẹ akwu arom obhon nwa, ifha oronga nden s'otzima orima obhon nwa abẹ o?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Mẹ wọ, Hanun ọbọkha anọng mba pa Devid ọtzọhmi ophyiri agba-phyubha okhubha wani, obiro ọbọkha anọhma-baba pabẹ ọjaakhi m'awọriba, okhubh bẹ abhana.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Mada Devid ọbhaang odik nwa, ọtzọhm akkaabh-nkkaabha bi bẹ atza akhebha anọng mba, da bẹ akk'bẹ ọgbasadik-barada ananga. Ọvaarnọng on-oben bi, “Bọng wobha ka Jeriko maa agba-phyubha pabọng amen yina bọng akhuna.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Mada anọng p'Ammọn an-are bi, bẹ akk'asa ettem epyibh Devid ttara bẹ, bẹ abher agbong-nọng p'Aram p'areng ka mmo nnọhna arọbh afa obhiri jobh, p'afon Bet-Rehob ọmaana Zoba. Wa ajinọng nnọhna mfa obhiri arọbh jobh abira afona k'ọvaarnọng kwa Maaka, nnọhna ẹrọbh obhiri jobh afona Tob.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Mada Devid ọbhaang odik nwa, ọtzọhm Joab otzima agbong-nọng pẹ p'erima biphyir ọtza. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Wa agbong-nọng p'Ammọn ado igbong-for, atza atzobha kẹ da adimi k'ẹbaakhamma ch'odedenmon. Agbong-nọng p'Aram kwa Zoba ọmaana Rehob, ọmaana ajinọng pa Tob ttara pa Maaka, apaangi atzobha k'ettegweng ch'ẹbaang mẹ.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Mada Joab ore bi, bẹ akk'for ada s'egbong atzikh-ẹ k'itzitzikha ttara ka nnama-nnam, otzekha agbong-nọng akkakka p'Israẹl otzobha bẹ atza arima agbong-nọng p'Aram abẹ. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Wa ọtzọkha agbong-nọng mbongo p'arikhi otte ọbọhk ọnang ọgbaanọkka Abishayi kw'otzobh bẹ, otzima bẹ ọtza orima agbong-nọng p'Ammọn abẹ. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Joab oben bi, “Idikha anọng p'Aram agaangi kpọng ayọhng-m, kọ kwu kkaan-m o. Yina, idikha anọng p'Ammọn bẹ agaangi kpọng ayọhng-ọ, kaam ńkwu okwu ńkwu nkkaan-ọ. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Kọ gaangi for morima erima nda mach'akkakkaama ka nho s'anọng paman, ọmaana ka nho s'idedenmon s'Ibinọkpaabyi kwaman. Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ósi-osi mach'ojibh-ẹ ka chen.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Mẹ wọ, Joab ọmaana agbong-nọng pẹ afona atza arima anọng p'Aram abẹ, anọng p'Aram arọbh ma bẹ k'itzitzikha. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Mada anọng p'Ammọn are bi anọng p'Aram am-arọbhi, bẹ arọbh aji Abishayi adim k'odedenmon. Mẹ wọ, Joab ọkwọhbha anọng p'Ammọn abẹ oririma, ọkpa nnam ọbhana ka Jẹrusalẹm.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Mada agbong-nọng p'Aram an-are bi, agbong-nọng p'Israẹl akk'bẹ akhema, bẹ afona abira atza ado atzobha. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Wa Hadadẹzẹr ofona ọtza ọtzọkha agbong-nọng p'Aram k'Ọraanga okhubha kwa Yupharetes, bẹ akwu apyiri k'obhon kwa Helam. Wa Shobak kw'ode odenho kw'agbong-nọng pa Hadadẹzẹr, otzima bẹ eden.<verse eid="2SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Mada bẹ agbaakhi Devid odik nwa, otzobha anọng p'Israẹl biphyir, otzima bẹ ojekha Jọrdan ochina ka Helam. Wa anọng p'Aram abe k'adik p'egbong atzik Devid bi, ifha bẹ arim-ẹ abẹ. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Yina, aSiriya arọbh m'itzitzikha s'anọng p'Israẹl. Wa Devid ofhu ayaar-akpaar pa nnyanyaang mmindọr anọng ẹnọhna obhiri arọbh chi, ọmaana agbong-nọng p'areng k'irerek anọng nnọhna arọbh azen. Wa obiro obun Shobak kw'ode odenho kw'agbong-nọng pabẹ ofhu. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Mada avaar biphyir p'awobh k'irekh-irek kwa Hadadẹzẹr are bi, anọng p'Israẹl akk'bẹ akhema, bẹ afona atza asi ẹmẹm ttara anọng p'Israẹl, bẹ an-abira awobha k'irekh-irek kwabẹ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:19">Mẹ wọ e, wa ojora osi anọng p'Aram bi, bẹ abira atza anang anọng p'Ammọn ẹkkaana.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọmaana Batshẹba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />M'ope-yaabhagbe, k'ogbe kw'avaar am-atza egbong, wa Devid ọtzọhm Joab ọmaana akhaan-nọng p'ọvaarnọng ttara anọng p'Israẹl biphyir egbong. Bẹ atza afhu anọng p'Ammọn, abira akhọri obhon kwa Raba akhe k'ottem. Yina, wa Devid owobha ka Jẹrusalẹm.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />K'ẹchọhkhawu dani, Devid obina k'ebin ọtza orenga ọkhọri ebir-ebir kw'ẹvaar-ttọhmma. Owobha kẹ ore kwanọng wani kw'om-ogbobha asi. Wa kwanọng nwuma ojibh-ojibh. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Wa Devid ọtzọhm ọnọng bi, otza oronga ọnọng kwa kwanọng nwa ode. Ojinọng nwuma ọgbaak Devid bi, “Batshẹba kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kw'Eliyam, obiro ode kwanọng kw'Uriya kw'ofon Het wọ e.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ọtzọhm akkaabh-nkkaabha pẹ atza atzim-ẹ akwu. Okwu opyiri, oyim-ẹ abẹ. Yina kw'iwa kwanọng nwa ọrami ọmmaana-dik kw'awurada pa for ottotto okyera mẹ. Iwa ọkpa nnam ọbhana. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Iwa kwanọng nwa otzima ibhọr, ọtzọhm ẹkkaabha ọnang Devid, oben bi, “Kaam nkk'ibhọr ndima e.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ọtzọhm ẹkkaabha ọnang Joab oben bi, “Tzọhm Uriya kw'ofon Het chen-m.” Wa Joab ọtzọhm-ẹ ochena Devid. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Mada Uriya okhebh-ẹ, Devid ọbọbh-ẹ odem kwa Joab owobh, ọmaana odem kw'agbong-nọng awobh ttara eden ch'egbong ede. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Mẹ wọ, Devid oben Uriya bi, “Rọhng atza agbobhi mmo k'ọhọhm kwọ.” Uriya otte ẹvaar-ttọhmma ọbọhk ofona, ọvaarnọng obiro ọtzọhm ẹnanga ochen-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Yina, iwa Uriya okponga mẹ ẹbaakhamma ch'ẹvaar-ttọhmma oyima ttara atzọhmnọng p'itta kwẹ, k'ọhọhm kwẹ kọtza.<verse eid="2SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Mada bẹ agbaakhi Devid bi, “Uriya k'ọhọhm kwẹ k'ọbhan e,” Devid ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Yina rang kw'afon k'oden-mir akwu ma o? Ode yan kw'ani k'ọhọhm kwọ abhan?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uriya oben Devid bi, “Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ọmaana anọng p'Israẹl ttara pa Juda ayim k'okhira, Joab kw'ode oho kwaam ọmaana atzọhmnọng p'itta kwaam, abhingi k'ọyaankpa. Okhuri yan kwa kaam nna mmana k'ọhọhm kwaam bi, nda nchi mbiri ngwo mbiri nyima ttara kwanọng kwaam o? Odem nwa kwa kọ arukhi akpen, kaam odik-dema nwa kinsi!”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Mẹ wọ e, Devid on-oben-ẹ bi, “Kọ biri wobha ma mayina, ophyini kaam ńdọhm-ọ akpa nnam.” Wa Uriya owobha ma Jẹrusalẹm m'ewu nduma ọmaana ewu ch'ehobh mẹ. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Devid oyer-ẹ okwu ochi ọchattọhk obiro agwo atzuk ttar-ẹ. Iwa Devid ọnang-ẹ atzuk maa obuma. Yina, m'ẹchọhkha, Uriya oyin k'iyaan otza oyima k'obhirikpa kwẹ, k'ottem kw'atzọhmnọng p'itta kwẹ; k'ọhọhm kwẹ kọbhan.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />K'ekpebha, Devid ọkkẹr ẹkkaabha k'ẹnwẹrkpa ọnang Uriya bi, ochena Joab. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Ọkkẹri m'ẹnwẹrkpa nduma bi, “Hok Uriya k'itzitzikha s'egbong, kw'erima ẹkhọhm-ọkhọhm. Atzọr akpa nnam ifha bẹ abun-ẹ afhu, ope.”<verse eid="2SA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Mẹ wọ, mada Joab okk'odedenmon ọkhọri okhe k'ottem, ọtzọkha Uriya ohok k'ibe s'orong bi akkakkaama p'attattaanga-nọng pabẹ awobh. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Mada ajinọng p'odedenmon nwuma ayini k'iyaan bi, bẹ akwu arima Joab abẹ, wa bẹ afhu agbong-nọng bani pa Devid. Ayongi mẹ, wa Uriya kw'ofon Het obiro ope.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Iwa Joab ọtzọhm Devid ẹkkaabha ch'odik kpenamkpen kw'otto k'egbong-dam. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Oben ọkkaabh-ẹkkaabha bi, “Idikha akk'ọvaarnọng odem kw'egbong ede agbaakha okpo, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />ọvaarnọng ọfha ọdọkh-ẹ, ọbọbh-ọ bi, ‘Okhuri yan kwa bọng atza arima egbong abaanga k'odedenmon o? Ode bi bọng karong bi, bẹ afha awobha k'echumiho atta ayukh o? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Anyi wọ ofhu Abimẹlẹk kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Jerub-Bẹshẹt? Kwanọng arang owobh k'echumiho obingi ẹtzakpa ch'ẹfhẹ-ẹ ka Tẹbẹz o? Okhuri yan kwa bọng areng abaanga k'echum o?’ Idikha ọbọbh-ọ idik nna, kọ gbaakh-ẹ bi, ‘Ayongi mẹ, ọtzọhmnọng kwọ Uriya kw'ofon Het obiro ope e.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Mẹ wọ e, ọkkaabh-ẹkkaabha nwuma obina ofona, mada opyiri, ọtzọkha odik kpenamkpen kwa Joab ọkk'ẹ ọtzọhma, ọgbaak Devid. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Ọkkaabh-ẹkkaabha nwuma oben Devid bi, “Ajinọng mbuma ayọhng man mkpaan, bẹ ayini k'iyaan akwu arima man abẹ k'ọyaankpa. Yina, mokhubhi bẹ maa bẹ akpa nnam k'ẹbaakhamma ch'odedenmon. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Mẹ wọ kw'atta-ayuk awobh k'echumiho atta atzọhmnọng pọ ayuk, ofona mẹ, atzọhmnọng bani p'ọvaarnọng ape. Ayongi mẹ, ọtzọhmnọng kwọ Uriya kw'ofon Het ọkk'ọpa.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Devid e, oben ọkkaabh-ẹkkaabha nwa bi, “Ben Joab bi, ‘Odik nwa oning-ọ ottem-pyibha ọnangi; ọkkangkkaang kw'ofhu ọnọng, óbiro ofhu ọnọng ọdọdọk. Tte ochina ororo orima odedenmon nwa abẹ obiro odim-ẹ.’ Kọ gbaak odik nwa atzim akhe Joab ẹfa.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Mada kwanọng kw'Uriya ọbhaang bi odim kwẹ ọkk'ọpa, owobha epopa ch'odim. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Mada ogbe kw'epopa ottong, Devid e, ọtza ọtzọkh-ẹ otzima ochina k'ọhọhm kwẹ, on-ode kwanọng kwẹ, ọmaan-ẹ nnwa kw'ijinọng. Yina, odik nwuma kwa Devid ọkk'ọsa, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ettem kọdaami.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Natan opyim Devid k'osisi kwẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Iwa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọtzọhm Natan ọtza okhebha Devid. Mada okhebh-ẹ, oben bi, “Iwa ọkhaam ajinọng afa p'afon k'obhon wani, oyok wani ode ọkkakkaa, nwonggo ode ogbogbora. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Ọkkakkaa nwa ọkhaam arukhimaan ọmaana abhaam k'ọhaabh. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Yina, ogbogbora ọttọhk kọkhaam, kw'oyongi orukhimaan-nwa-kwakwẹ kẹ-khẹ kw'okk'odebha. Ọrọkh-ẹ maa, orukhimaan-nwa nwa ọbar ọmaana va p'ojinọng nwa. Orukhimaan nwa om-ochi ọchattọhk ttara ojinọng nwa, om-obiro ogwo asi ka nkọbh kw'ojinọng nwa, obiro ọttaabh-ẹ ka mbọhk. Wa orukhimaan-nwa nwa on-ode macha nnwa kw'ikwanọng ọnang-ẹ.<verse eid="2SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />“Iwa okhekhen-nọng wani okwu ọhakha ọkkakkaa nwa, yina, ọkkakkaa nwa obhum bi ọtzọkha arukhimaan pẹ, obiro ode abhaam pẹ bi, otzima osi ọchattọhk ọtzaam okhekhen-nọng kw'ọkk'ẹ ọhakha. Ottu kw'osi mando, ọn-ọtza ọtzọkha orukhimaan-nwa-kwakwẹ kw'ogbogbora otzima osi ọchattọhk ọtzaam okhekhen-nọng kw'ọkk'ẹ ọhakha.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Odik nwuma ọdọkhi Devid maa, oben Natan bi, “Odem nwa kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi orukhi akpen, ojinọng kw'osi odik-dema nwa ọbaan bi ope! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Kẹ ọkhaambi otzuk orukhimaan nwa k'igbe inna, okhuri bi, inọngkwo kọkhaam m'odik nwa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Mẹ wọ, Natan oben Devid bi, “Kọ wọ ade ojinọng nwuma! Ma wọ ode odik kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl ọgbaakhi: ‘Kaam mbyeng-ọ ana k'eho, nsọ-ọ ọvaarnọng kw'Israẹl. Mbiri nkkaan-ọ nnọbh-ọ ka mbọhk sa Saul. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Kaam ndọk ẹhọhmmọr ch'itta kwọ nnang-ọ, mbiri ndọkha panọng pẹ nnang-ọ. Nsọ-ọ ọvaarnọng kw'Israẹl ọmaana kwa Juda. Idikha ira idik nna in-ihaabhi, kaam ira nnang-ọ nyongi mẹ. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ode yan kwa kọ abhumi atzim p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bi, kọ asi obibya-dik-dema nwa k'itzitzikha sẹ o? Kọ atzim ọkkangkkaang afhu Uriya kw'ofon Het, abira atzọkha kwanọng kwẹ aba. Kọ atzim ọkkangkkaang kw'anọng p'Ammọn afhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Kẹ wọ osi, ọkkangkkaang ẹhọhmmọr chọ ọbọhk kótte, okhuri da kọ abhumi atzim paam, afona atza atzọkha kwanọng kw'Uriya kw'ofon Het aba.’<verse eid="2SA 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />“Ma wọ ode odik kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obeni: ‘Kaam ńdọhm itzama s'ítto ikhebh-ọ k'ẹhọhmmọr chọ. Kọ atzima chen pọ are da ńdọkha panọng pọ nnang oyokh-ẹbaanga kwọ, kẹ óyima panọng pọ abẹ k'ọyaankpa. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Kọ asi odik nwa ka ndubhama, yina, kaam ńna nsi kwẹ k'ọyaankpa k'itzitzikha s'anọng p'Israẹl biphyir.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Mẹ wọ, Devid oben Natan bi, “Kaam nkk'ẹkhọhngkwuri nsa k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Natan obhina bi, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkk'ọ obina ọnang k'ẹkhọngkwuri chọ. Kọ kápe. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Yina, okhuri da akk'asa bi attattaanga-nọng p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi alukh-ẹ, nnwa nwuma kw'ijinọng kwa bẹ amaani anang-ọ, ópe-ope.”<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Mada Natan okk'nnam ọkpa ọbhana k'ọhọhm kwẹ, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi nnwa nwuma kwa kwanọng kw'Uriya ọkk'ọmaana ọnang Devid, otto ọkhọhmana. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Wa Devid okhukhi Ibinọkpaabyi okhuri nnwa nwa. Otzim ọchattọhk obiro ọfọra abara-bina oyima k'irerek m'erungiwu nduma. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Wa adedennọng pẹ am-akhonga bi abọhkh-ẹ obina k'irerek, yina, obhum bi obina. Obiro obhum bi ochi ọchattọhk kpenamkpen ttara bẹ.<verse eid="2SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Ottong iwu izenamfa nnwa nwuma ope. Wa akhaan-nọng pa Devid ojor bẹ ojora bi, bẹ agbaakh-ẹ bi, nnwa nwa ọkk'ọpa, da bẹ achibhi bi, “K'ogbe kw'iwa nnwa nwa otzim orukhi akpen, idikha mọgbaakhi Devid atzim, man itzọhng kokher bi oyonga. Morenga yan ọgbaakh-ẹ bi, nnwa nwuma ọkk'ọpa o? Kẹ ofha osi odik-ttama, ọnang fọr sẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Mada Devid ore da akhaan-nọng pẹ an-am-akkaabha ayok iyaabhi, otzin bi nnwa nwuma ọkk'ọpa. Mẹ wọ, ọbọbh bi, “Nnwa nwuma ọkk'ọpa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Bẹ abhina bi, “O o, ọkk'ọpa e.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Mẹ wọ, Devid obina k'irerek. Mada okk'asi ogbobha obiro ọkpan ana, obhona ẹnya, obina ochina k'ọhọhm kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ọtza okpobh-ẹ. Yina on-ochin k'ọhọhm kwẹ, oben bẹ anang-ẹ ọchattọhk, ochi.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Akhaan-nọng pẹ abọbh-ẹ bi, “Kọ am-asi yan ma o? K'ogbe kw'iwa nnwa nwa otzim orukhi akpen, atzimi ọchattọhk abira awobha k'obhoma, mada nnwa nwa ọkk'ọn-ọpa, an-abina achi ọttọhk!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Obhina bi, “K'ogbe kw'iwa nnwa nwa otzim orukhi akpen, kaam ndimi ọchattọhk nwobha k'obhoma. Iwa nchibhi bi, ‘K'odik-ọkka, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọfha ọkhaama inọngkwo ttar-m, otte nnwa nwa ọbọhk oruk akpen.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Yina, mada ọkk'ọn-ọpa, kaam nna nchina ororo ndim ọchattọhk fa mbọng o? Na kaam mfha ndima akpen pẹ mkpa nnam o? Kaam wọ nder ńgebha kẹ kẹ e, kẹ arang obiro ọkpa nnam okhebh-m ka e!”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ẹmmaana cha Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Mẹ wọ, Devid odini kwanọng kwẹ Batshẹba nttem, otza oyim-ẹ abẹ, otzima ibhọr, ọmaan-ẹ nnwa kw'ijinọng, bẹ akpẹ-ẹ Sọlọmọn. Nnwa nwa ọdaak Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi; <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />okhuri idadaakha nnuma, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọtzọhm Natan, kw'ode ọsẹjaakhi ọtza sẹ che ọkpẹ-ẹ, Jedidiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'eHiburu, che cha Jedidiya eyini, kẹ ọdaakhi Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.</char></note>.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />M'ogbe nwuma wa Joab orim egbong ttara obhon kwa Raba kw'ode kw'anọng p'Ammọn, obiro ọbọkha ọvaarbhon kwabẹ otzima. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Iwa Joab ọtzọhm akkaabh-nkkaabha atza akhebha Devid aben bi, “Kaam nkk'Raba abẹ nnima, mbiri ndọkha odedenmon kw'asi pẹ. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Bọng dobha agbong-nọng p'arikhi, akhọri odedenmon nwa akhe k'ottem, bọng abira abọkh-ẹ atzima. Oni mando ode, kaam mbọkha odedenmon nwa ndima, mkpẹ-ẹ che mmina kaam.”<verse eid="2SA 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Mando kwa Devid otzobh agbong-nọng biphyir otzima ochina ka Raba, orima bẹ abẹ maa okhema bẹ. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Wa ọwọra ọvaarnọng kwabẹ ivaar-kpo k'eho, bẹ atzọkha fọr-ẹ. Ivaar-kpo nna idọhbhi ipyiri talẹn wani kwa gol, bẹ abira dokha sẹ ttara atza ọkkakka. Wa Devid obiro ochi ọgbọm k'ọhaabh m'odedenmon nwuma. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Ọtzọkha anọng p'awobh mẹ ọnang itzọhm sa bẹ atzim ọkkaangi ọmaana s'akkonga, ọmaana s'ochitzọhkhi ttara sa mbar asi, obiro osi bẹ asi ọtzọhm f'idọdọhbh ọbabanga. Wa Devid osi odik nwa k'ibhon s'anọng p'Ammọn biphyir. Mẹ wọ e, kẹ Devid ọmaana agbong-nọng pẹ biphyir akpa nnam abhana ka Jẹrusalẹm.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amnọn ọmaana Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Iwa Absalọm kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Devid ọkhaam ọgbaanọkka kw'ikwanọng kw'ojobh-ojibh kw'okpen Tama. Wa k'ogbe wani, Amnọn kw'ode nnwa kwa Devid okwu ọkhaama idadaakha ttara Tamar.<verse eid="2SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Iwa Amnọn otto ọkhọhmana okhuri da okhe ettem chẹ k'ọgbaanotte Tama. Wa Tama ojinọng otzim oronga, kw'osi Amnọn ore kwẹ bi, ode odik kw'ọgaang-ẹ ọgaangi bi, oyim-ẹ abẹ.<verse eid="2SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Yina, wa Amnọn ọkhaam oyokh-odikkobh kw'okpen Jonadab, kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Shimeyi, kw'ode ọgbaanọtte kwa Devid. Jonadab kẹ wa ode ojinọng kw'odongi-odongi. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Ọbọbh Amnọn bi, “Ode yan kwa kọ nnwa kw'ọvaarnọng, am-akkeri idọdọkhi-idọdọkhi ekpebha kpenamkpen manda o? Gbaak-m odik.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Amnọn obhin-ẹ bi, “Tama kw'ode ọgbaanọkka kw'Absalọm kwa mode ọgbaanotte ọkk'aam ọdaakha e.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Jonadab oben bi, “Rọhng atza ayima k'ebin asi nkkari bi, ọmmọ-ọ ọmma. Mada isa atte okwu bi ọrọ-ọ ben-ẹ bi, ‘Kaam ira ọdaakh-m bi ọgbaanotte kwaam Tama okwu osi ọchattọhk ọnang-m e. Tte owobha m'itzitzikha saam osi ọchattọhk mva, ifha nnẹ-ẹ mbiri nchi fẹ ma mbọhk sẹ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Mẹ wọ, Amnọn osi nkkari otza oyima mach'ọmmẹ-ẹ ọmma. Mada ọvaar Devid okwu bi ọrẹ-ẹ, Amnọn oben-ẹ bi, “Kaam ira ọdaakh-m bi, ọgbaanotte kwaam Tama okwu osi ọchattọhk f'ọm-ọdaakh-m m'itzitzikha ọnang-m, ifha oreng-mmo ọyọkh-m fẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Iwa Devid ọtzọhm bẹ ayeri Tama k'ẹvaar-ttọhmma, oben-ẹ bi, “Rọhng k'ọhọhm kw'agbaanatte Amnọn, atza asi ọchattọhk anang-ẹ.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Mando kwa Tama obin ochina k'ọhọhm kw'ọgbaanotte Amnọn, kw'okhebh da oyim k'ebin. Tama ọtzọkha abubuma ọbhakhi otzima osi brẹd m'itzitzikha sẹ. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Ọtzọkha brẹd nwa okhe k'ikkoriya otza ober-ẹ, yina, obhum ochichi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:9">Amnọn on-oben bi, “Bọng ben ọnọng kpenamkpen oyin k'iyaan.” Mẹ wọ, ọnọng kpenamkpen obina oyin k'iyaan. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Amnọn e oben Tama bi, “Tzini ọchattọhk mvuma achen-m k'ẹmaanggọ chaam, ifha areng-mmo ọyọkh-m fẹ.” Tama otzini brẹd nwa kw'ọkk'ọsa otzima odim k'ẹmaanggọ ch'ọgbaanotte, Amnọn. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Yina, mada otzini ochattọhk mvuma ochen-ẹ bi ochi, ọkhaabh-ẹ, oben bi, “Ọgbaanotte kwaam, vura k'ebin, akwu mọtzọn oyima.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Oben-ẹ bi, “Mma e, ọgbaanotte kwaam! Kaam k'ẹfa kàbọkha ayima abẹ! Anọng odik-dema nwa k'Israẹl atzima abhaanga o! Odik-ttama-dema nwa kàsi. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Kaam ọmaana kọ móruk yan ttara ọgbasa-dik nwa o? Kọ an-ade mach'odidingi-nọng wani m'Israẹl e. Tzotzokhaan, gbaak ọvaarnọng, kẹ kọ eden kọkpa bi, atzọkh-m k'ọbada.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Kaambi mẹ wọ, itzọhng koyong ọnang-ẹ, ọbọkh-ẹ oyima abẹ k'ẹfa, okhuri da ọkhaam ẹfa ọyọhng-ẹ.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Mẹ wọ, Amnọn ọn-ọttaang-ẹ itzam-itzama. K'odik-ọkka, wa ọn-ọttaang-ẹ maa ọyọhnga eden ch'iwa ọdaakh-ẹ. Amnọn on-oben-ẹ bi, “Bina ayin k'iyaan afona!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamar oben-ẹ bi, “Mma e! Akhubh-m okhubh, mẹ wọ on-opyibhi ọtzam ọyọhnga odik kw'akk'aam atzama asa e.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Kaambi mẹ wọ, Amnọn itzọhng koyong ọnang-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />On-oyeri ọtzọhmnọng kwẹ oben bi, “Tzima kwanọng nwa ayin k'iyaan, agbakh-ẹ ọmma!” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Mando kw'ọtzọhmnọng kwẹ ọbhar-ẹ k'iyaan, ọgbakh-ẹ ọmma. Wa Tamar ọfọr owura-baba kw'ọgaangi ẹphya, kw'ode owura-baba kw'iwa aminava p'ọvaarnọng p'ani ojinọng atzim aronga am-afọra. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Tama ọtza okpokhi itzọtzọhng obum-ẹ k'eho, ọbọkha owura-baba kw'ọfọr ka for ọjaakhi. Otzini mbọhk ọtzọhkha k'eho, obhom k'ẹrọng ofona.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Ọgbaanọkka Absalọm ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Agbaanatte Amnọn, ọkk'ọ abẹ oyima? Ọgbaanọkka kwaam, dọk kàbhom; kẹ ode ọgbaanotte kwọ e. Odik nwa k'ettem kàkhe.” Tama on-oruk ttara nkwu-osisi k'ọhọhm kw'ọgbaanọkka, Absalọm.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Mada ọvaar Devid ọbhaang idik nna, ettem epyibh-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Absalọm odik manda wani kw'ojibh-ojibh obiro opyibh-opyibh kw'okhuri odik nwa, kọgbaakhi ọnang Amnọn. Yina, ọttaanga Amnọn k'ọgbarsadik kw'ọkk'ọsa ọnang ọgbaanọkka, Tama.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Absalọm ofhu Amnọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Mada cho afa akk'akwọbha, k'ogbe kw'atzọhmnọng p'Absalọm p'am-aphyiri arukhimaan ophyubha awobh ka Baal-Hazọr, kẹ ọbaanga Ephraim, wa Absalọm obher va p'ijinọng biphyir p'ọvaarnọng m'ẹrọm nduma. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Mẹ wọ, Absalọm ofona ọtza okhebha ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Atzọhmnọng paam am-aphyiri arukhimaan ophyubha. Tzotzokhaan, tte ọvaarnọng ọmaana akhaan-nọng pẹ akwu awobha ttar-m!”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Mma e, nnwa kwaam, tte man biphyir oningi ọtza e. Kwẹ ọdọhbh-ọ kpọng e.” Chibhi da Absalọm ọgban-ẹ, kokher bi ọtza, yina, okhinggẹ ọsẹ-ẹ ittabọhng.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Mẹ wọ, Absalọm oben bi, “Idikha an-afha akwu, tzotzokhaan, tte ọgbaanotte kwaam Amnọn ọbọhk ọtzọn man abẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Ọvaarnọng ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Ka yan kwa kẹ ọtzọn-ọ abẹ o?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Yina, Absalọm ochina ororo ọgban-ẹ maa, ọvaarnọng otte Amnọn ọmaana va mbonggo p'ijinọng ọbọhk, bẹ atzọn Absalọm abẹ, afona.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Mada bẹ apyiri kẹ, Absalọm oben atzọhmnọng pẹ bi, “Bọng yonga itzọhng! Mada isa atzuk asi ettem ẹdaam Amnọn, mbeni bọng bi, ‘Bọng fhu Amnọn,’ bọng afhẹ-ẹ, oningi bọng ojor. Kaam wọ nnangi bọng ẹfa. Bọng bar ettem asi ejinọng.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Wa atzọhmnọng p'Absalọm asi Amnọn mach'okk'bẹ ẹfa ọnanga. Mẹ wọ e, va p'ijinọng biphyir p'ọvaarnọng abina atza avura nnyanyaang sabẹ arọbh afona.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Mada bẹ am-arenga k'eden, ẹkkaabha epyiri Devid bi, “Absalọm okk'va p'ijinọng biphyir p'ọvaarnọng ọfha, ọnọng manda wani korikhi.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Ọvaarnọng obina obe, ọjaakhi ẹnya ch'ọfọr obiro oyima k'irerek; akhaan-nọng pẹ biphyir ajaakhi nnya sa bẹ fọr abira awobha mẹ ttar-ẹ.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Yina, Jonadab kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Shimeyi, kw'ode ọgbaanotte kwa Devid oben bi, “Itta kwaam oningi ọtzọk bi, bẹ afhu avaar-va p'ijinọng biphyir; Amnọn kẹ-khẹ wọ ope e. Ode ochibhi kw'Absalọm ọkk'ọtzam ọkhaama, ttẹwọr k'ewu ch'Amnọn oyim ọgbaanọkka Tama abẹ k'ẹfa e. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, ettem ening-ọ atzim ẹyakhi k'ẹkkaabha ch'epyir-ọ bi, avaar-va p'ijinọng biphyir akk'apa e. Amnọn kẹ-khẹ wọ ope.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Ayongi mẹ, Absalọm ọkk'ọrọbha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Mada ojinọng kw'om-okkeri ibe otzini chen okkeri k'ororo, ore anọng k'ọhaabh k'eden k'okhubha kw'ewuchen em-edimi, p'am-ahakha k'egbegbeho ọkhaan-ọkhaan. Okker-ibe nwa ofona ọtza ọgbaak ọvaarnọng bi, “Nne ajinọng k'okhubha kwa Horonayim k'egbegbeho ọkhaan-ọkhaan e.”<verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Jonadab oben ọvaarnọng bi, “Kker e, va p'ijinọng p'ọvaarnọng akk'akwa e; kwẹ ọkk'ọda macha kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ, mbeni.”<verse eid="2SA 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Okyer atzim ọgbagbaak mẹ, va p'ijinọng p'ọvaarnọng apyiri ttara obhoma k'ẹrọng. Wa ọvaarnọng ọmaana akhaan-nọng pẹ biphyir abira abhom k'idọdọhkhi.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Wa Absalọm ọrọbhi ochina ka Talmayi kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kw'Amihud, kw'ode ọvaarnọng kwa Geshur. Yina, wa ọvaar Devid owobha ka nkwu-osisi s'obo kwa nnwa kwẹ Amnọn, k'ewu kpenamkpen.<verse eid="2SA 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Mada Absalọm ọrọbhi ochina ka Geshur, wa owobh kẹ ka cho attaan. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Wa ọvaar Devid odini for sẹ nttem k'obo kw'Amnọn, obiro ọdaakh-ẹ bi, ira ore Absalọm.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Absalọm ọkpa nnam ka Jẹrusalẹm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Iwa Joab kw'ode nnwa kwa Zeruya, orong bi, ettem ch'ọvaarnọng ẹgban k'Absalọm. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Mẹ wọ, iwa Joab ọtzọhm ọnọng k'obhon kwa Tẹkoa, bẹ atza atzọkha kwanọng wani kw'odongi-odongi atzima akwu. Wa Joab oben-ẹ bi, “Kọ si nkkari bi awobh epopa. Afọra abara-bina. Ana manda bani kàkpan. Si mach'ọnọng kw'okk'epopa owobha k'iwu-haabhada. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Rọhng k'ọvaarnọng atza agbaakh-ẹ atzim mba.” Wa Joab, ọtzaakh-ẹ atzim p'ọtza ọgbaak.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Mada kwanọng nwa kw'ofon Tẹkoa ọgbaakhi ọvaarnọng atzim, ọrakha ottima itzitzikha m'irerek ọnang ọvaarnọng ikpokpobha, oben bi, “Ọvaarnọng, kkaan-m e!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Ọvaarnọng ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Mbọng vọ ode odik kw'ọyakh-ọ atzim?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Kwanọng nwa oben bi, “Kaam nde opopa-kwanọng, da odim kwaam ọkk'ọpa e. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ, ngaam va afa p'ijinọng. Wa bẹ akwu arima ayok abẹ k'owoni, k'ogbe kw'ọnọng on'ode kw'ọkkaan bẹ erima. Wa oyok wani obun oyok ofhu. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Mẹ wọ, efona chaam biphyir ẹkk'ẹttaanga ẹnang ọtzọhmnọng kwọ. Bẹ am-aben-m bi, ‘Nang man oyok kw'ofhu ọgbaanọkka, ifha mọfhẹ-ẹ, k'akpen p'ọgbaanọkka p'odimi, kaambi ode bi, modimi ọnọng kw'ọbaan k'ebocha.’ Ma, bẹ an-adimi akpen pa nnwa wani kẹ-khẹ kw'orikh-m. Bẹ abira adimi odim kwaam che, ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr chẹ m'ọyagbin.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Iwa ọvaarnọng oben kwanọng nwa bi, “Rọhng abhana, kaam ńsi ẹmọng osi m'odik nwa.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Kaambi mẹ wọ, kwanọng nwa kw'ofon Tẹkoa oben-ẹ bi, “Tte itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, obina ọnang kaam ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr ch'otte kwaam. Tte ọvaarnọng ọmaana ẹvaar chẹ, bẹ aningi oponga-pyibha atzọk.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Ọvaarnọng obhina bi, “Idikha ọnọng manda wani ọyakh-ọ atzim, kọ tzim-ẹ akwu. Kẹ kọ ọttọhk kósi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Kwanọng nwa obhina bi, “Tte ọvaarnọng ochekhi ka che ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwẹ bi, kẹ ọnọng manda wani ọbọhk kotte bi, otzukha ẹnọngmon-barada nda, ifha bẹ aningi akpen pa nwa kwaam adimi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Ọvaarnọng obhina bi, “Da Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi orukhi akpen, esisa-naanga cha nnwa kwọ ch'etto k'irerek kede.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Mẹ wọ, kwanọng nwa oben bi, “Tte kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ mgbaak atzim nnang itta ọvaarnọng kwaam.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Ọvaarnọng obhin-ẹ bi, “Kọ gbaak.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Kwanọng nwa on-oben bi, “Okhuri yan kwa kọ aphaari itzama-dema nna atzima atzor anọng p'Ibinọkpaabyi o?” Idikha ọvaarnọng ọgbaakhi odik-dema nwa, for sẹ arang s'ọbhakhi opyima ma o, da ọvaarnọng oni nnwa kwẹ kw'okhubhi, otzim-otzima ọkpa nnam o? <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Mọkhaambi ope mach'asi abyengi k'irerek, p'ọnọng oni dọk ọfha otzima ọkpa nnam. Ochibhi kw'Ibinọkpaabyi mando kode. Yina, kẹ om-otzer ohok aphaangi bi, ọnọng kwa bẹ akk'akhubha ofona, obiro orenga mẹ ọkpa nnam otzor-ẹ.<verse eid="2SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />“Kaam nkk'nkwa bi, nkwu mgbaak itta ọvaarnọng kwaam odik nwa, okhuri bi, anọng mba akk'asa bi ojor-m. Ọtzọhmnọng kwọ okk'ochibhi bi, ‘Kaam ḿgbaak itta ọvaarnọng kwaam atzim, asi mẹ, kẹ ósi-osi otzor k'ephyema ch'ọtzọhmnọng kwẹ. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Asi mẹ, ọvaarnọng okher-okhera bi, ọkkaana ọrọbha ọtzọhmnọng kwẹ ka mbọhk s'ojinọng kw'om-okhonga bi, odimi ekkema cha kaam ọmaana nnwa kwaam ch'Ibinọkpaabyi ọnangi man.’<verse eid="2SA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />“Kẹ wọ osi ọtzọhmnọng kwọ oben bi, ‘Tte atzim p'itta ọvaarnọng kwaam anang-m ẹwọhng-kwokha, da itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, ode mach'orenga-eden kw'Ibinọkpaabyi kw'orong ejibha ọmaana epyibha. Tte ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwọ, owobha ttar-ọ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Mẹ wọ, ọvaarnọng e oben kwaanọng nwa bi, “Kaam ebhina ch'odik kwa ḿbọbh-ọ ma, kàdubha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Kwanọng nwa oben bi, “Tte itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, ọbọbh.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Ọvaarnọng ọbọbh bi, “Kachibhi bi, ọbọhk kwa Joab owobh m'odik nwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Kwanọng nwa obhina bi, “Da kọ itta ọvaarnọng kwaam arukhi akpen, ọnọng manda wani kw'ósi odik ngọmi oyongi kw'itta ọvaarnọng kwaam ọgbaakhi kode. Ode mando bi, ọtzọhmnọng kwọ Joab wọ ọtzọhn-m bi, nsi odik nwa. Kẹ wọ obiro ọtzaakhi kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ atzim mba biphyir. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Wa Joab kw'ode ọtzọhmnọng kwọ osi odik nwa, ifha otzima ọbhakhi idik ewobha. Itta kwaam ọkhaam ekkoji mach'orenga-eden kw'Ibinọkpaabyi, kẹ orong odik kpenamkpen kw'otto m'irerek nna.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Mẹ wọ, ọvaarnọng oben Joab bi, “Ojibhi kẹ, kaam ńsi-osi mando. Kọ rọhng atza atzima Absalọm, kw'ode odikkobh akpa nnam.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Joab otto okhubha itzitzikha sẹ m'irerek ọnang-ẹ ikpokpobha, obiro odo ọvaarnọng. Joab oben bi, “Kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ nkk'nnonga bi, nkk'ọphyaam ndọkha k'itzitzikha s'itta ọvaarnọng kwaam mayina e, okhuri da, ọvaarnọng ọkk'ọtzọhmnọng kwẹ ephyema chẹ ọnanga.”<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Mẹ wọ, Joab ofona ochina ka Geshur ọtza ọtzọkha Absalọm otzima ọkpa nnam ka Jẹrusalẹm. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Yina, ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Kẹ ọkhaambi ochina k'ọhọhm kwẹ. Kọkhaambi ore itzitzikha saam.” Mando kw'iwa Absalọm ọkpa nnam ochina k'ọhọhm kwẹ, itzitzikha s'ọvaarnọng kore.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Iwa k'Israẹl biphyir ojinọng kwa bẹ atzọhng k'ajibhada mach'Absalọm kode. Ttẹwọr k'eho maa ahakha ka mmokpatzọkhi sẹ, enyu kọkhaam. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Iwa kẹ om-ophyiri isisa s'eho chẹ, da cho ọn-ọha, okhuri da sẹ im-idọhbh-ẹ ọdọhbh. Ogbe kpenamkpen kw'ophyiri isisa sẹ, edọhbh ch'isisa sẹ im-ipyiri ashẹkẹl arọbh jobh, atzor k'odem kwa bẹ am-ayoma ẹdọhbh ch'ekpo k'ọvaar-họhm.<verse eid="2SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Iwa Absalọm obhoni va p'ijinọng attaan ọmaana nnwa kw'ikwanọng. Wa nnwa kw'ikwanọng okpen Tamar, ojibh kwanọng.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Iwa Absalọm orukhi ka Jẹrusalẹm cho afa, yina, itzitzikha s'ọvaarnọng kọfha ore. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Absalọm ọtzọhm bi, bẹ ayeri Joab anang-ẹ, ifha ọtzọhm-ẹ k'ọvaarnọng. Yina, Joab obhum eyeri nduma. Absalọm obiro ọtzọhm ottong igbe ifa bi, bẹ ayer-ẹ, obiro obhum eyeri nduma. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Mando kw'obeni atzọhmnọng pẹ bi, “Bọng kker e, owoni kwa Joab kw'owobh ọbaanga kwaam, ọkhaam abarli. Bọng nọhng atza akwọm-ẹ.” Mando kw'atzọhmnọng p'Absalọm akwọmi owoni kwa Joab.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Joab ofona ọtza okhebha Absalọm oben-ẹ bi, “Okhuri yan kw'atzọhmnọng pọ atza akwọmi owoni kwaam o?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Absalọm oben Joab bi, “Kker e, kaam ndọhmi ẹkkaabha, mben bi, ‘Kwu ifha ndọhm-ọ atza abọbh ọvaarnọng bi, okhuri yan kwa kaam mfon ka Geshur ngwuna ma o? Ira ojibh ọtzam ọnang-m bi, nwobh ka Geshur!’ Ma, kaam nna nnori bi nne itzitzikha s'ọvaarnọng e. Idikha ngaam oponga-pyibha manda wani kẹ, tte kẹ ofhu-m e.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Mẹ wọ, Joab ofona ochina k'ọvaarnọng otza ọgbaakh-ẹ odik nwa. Wa ọvaarnọng oyeri Absalọm, kw'okwu ọrakha ọvaarnọng m'itzitzikha, ottima itzitzikha m'irerek. Iwa ọvaarnọng ọbaakha Absalọm.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Achibhi-tzama p'Absalọm osi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Okwu otzuma k'ogbe mẹ, Absalọm otzini ọkpaar kwa nnyanyaang mmindọr, ọmaana nnyanyaang, okwu ọttara k'ajinọng arọbh afa obhiri jobh bi, bẹ achẹ-ẹ eden. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Iwa kẹ ọm-ọphyọbha k'ekpekpebha ọtza obe k'eden ọkhaan-ọkhaan ch'echin k'ẹbaakhamma ch'odedenmon. Ogbe kpenamkpen kw'ọnọng otzim aponga bi, ọtza okhebha ọvaarnọng, ifha ọttọhna, Absalọm om-oyeri ọnọng nwuma ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Kọ afon bọng obhon?” Ọnọng nwuma obhina bi, “Ọtzọhmnọng kwọ ofon k'ẹkhọma dani ch'Israẹl.” <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Mẹ wọ, Absalọm on-oben-ẹ bi, “Kker e, aponga mba adaami kọ, bẹ abira otzor-otzor, yina, ọnọng kw'oyong-ọ itzọhng k'eho ch'ọvaarnọng kode e.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Absalọm ọttara bi, “Idikha ira bẹ asi-m osi-aponga m'irerek nna e! Ira ọnọng kpenamkpen ọkhaam odik kw'ọyakh-ẹ atzim, obiro ode iponga o, ofha okwu okhebh-m, kaam ńsi aponga pẹ adaam-ẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Ogbe kpenamkpen kw'ọnọng oreng otzor Absalọm ka for bi, ọrakha ottima itzitzikha k'irerek orim-ẹ, Absalọm om-onemi ọbọhk ọbọkh-ẹ obina, ọbaakh-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Wa Absalọm om-osi mando ọnang anọng p'Israẹl biphyir, p'akwu aror eponga-ttọhna ch'etzor-otzor k'ọvaarnọng. Wa om-osi mando otzima odebh nttem s'anọng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Mada cho anna akk'akwọbha, iwa Absalọm oben ọvaarnọng bi, “Tte kaam nda ka Hẹbrọn, ifha nda ńsi ẹjaakhi ch'echekhi ch'iwa nsi nnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Mada iwa ọtzọhmnọng kwọ orukhi ka Geshur k'ẹkhọma ch'Aram, iwa kaam nsi echekhi bi: ‘Idikha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otzim-m ọkpa nnam ka Jẹrusalẹm, kaam ḿkpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ka Hẹbrọn.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Ọvaarnọng oben-ẹ bi, “Rọhng k'odidiri.” Mando kw'Absalọm ofon ochina ka Hẹbrọn.<verse eid="2SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Iwa Absalọm ọtzọhm nttọ ka ngọma s'Israẹl makhọra bi, bẹ atza aben bi, “Isa bọng abhaang da bẹ agyi abukpọhng <char style="it">bi kpaar</char>, bọng kpebh amọng aben bi, Absalọm ọkk'ọvaarnọng ọda ka Hẹbrọn e!” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Wa ajinọng arọbh jobh p'afon ka Jẹrusalẹm bọ atzọni Absalọm abẹ. Wa obheri bẹ mach'anọng p'akwu odik kw'abẹ an-arong. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Mada Absalọm om-osi njafọhni, wa obiro ọtzọhm bẹ ayeri Ahitophẹl kw'ofon Gilo, kw'ọm-ọnang Devid ndọhna, ofona ka Gilo kw'ode obhon kwẹ okwu. Mẹ wọ, achibhi-tzama p'Absalọm an-ado ẹfa akhaama, anọng p'atzọni Absalọm abẹ, abira ochina ororo ahaabh.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devid ọrọbhi oji Jẹrusalẹm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Iwa ọkkaabh-ẹkkaabha wani okwu ọgbaak Devid bi, “Nttem s'anọng p'Israẹl nwobh k'Absalọm.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Mando kwa Devid obeni atzọhmnọng pẹ biphyir p'awobh ttar-ẹ ka Jẹrusalẹm bi, “Bọng kwu! Mọrọbh, oni mando ode, ọnọng manda wani kw'ọnaanga ka mbọhk s'Absalọm kóde. Mọkhaambi obina ofona ẹbhar-ẹbhar, oni mando ode, kẹ ọ́tza ọ́khọbha man ọkhọbha ódimi man, óbiro otzima ọkkangkkaang ofhu anọng p'odedenmon.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Akhaan-nọng p'ọvaarnọng abhin-ẹ bi, “Atzọhmnọng pọ akk'for ada atzik bi, bẹ asi kpenamkpen f'itta ọvaarnọng kwaman ochibhi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Mando kw'ọvaarnọng obin orenga, anọng p'ẹhọhmmọr chẹ biphyir atzọn-ẹ abẹ. Yina, iwa obin oji akkọra-panọng pẹ jobh bi, bẹ awobha akkeri ẹvaar-ttọhmma. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Wa ọvaarnọng otzima anọng biphyir p'atzọn-ẹ abẹ obina orenga, bẹ abe k'odedenmon ọkhaan-ọkhaan. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Wa atzọhmnọng pẹ biphyir achẹ-ẹ eden akwọbha. Ajinọng pa Kẹrẹt ọmaana pa Pẹlẹt ttara pa Git p'ade ẹnọhna obhiri arọbh jobh biphyir p'atzọn-ẹ abina ka Gat, am-abira arenga ọvaarnọng k'itzitzikha.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Ọvaarnọng on-oben Ittayi kw'ofon Git bi, “Okhuri yan kwa kọ atzọn man abẹ o? Kọ ade okhekhennọng kw'arọbhi ebira k'obhon kwọ. Kpa nnam atza awobha ttara ọvaar Absalọm. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Ikhena-ikhena wọ kw'akwu. On-orenga yan kaam nttọ-ọ ọbọhk awenna ttara man, k'ogbe kwa nni ibe nnong sa mminda-ọtza o? Kọ tzima anọng pọ biphyir kpa nnam. Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ọphyaam ọnang bọng, obiro ọkhọhkha bọng idadaakha.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Yina, Ittayi on-obhina ọvaarnọng bi, “Odem kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi orukhi akpen, ọmaana k'odem kw'itta ọvaarnọng kwaam obiro oruk akpen, ibe kpenamkpen s'itta ọvaarnọng kwaam owobh, kaambi ode obo, obiro ode akpen o, mẹ wọ kwa kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ, ńwobha.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Devid oben Ittayi bi, “Kọ rọhng, abina orenga.” Mando kw'Ittayi kw'ofon Git obin orenga ọmaana ajinọng pẹ, ttara nhọhmmọr sa nwobh ttar-ẹ.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Iwa anọng biphyir p'ẹkhọma nda abhom amọng k'ẹrọng, k'ogbe kw'anọng mba am-arenga akwọbha. K'ogbe kw'ọvaarnọng om-ojekha Ẹttẹri cha Kidrọn, akhaan-nọng pẹ biphyir atzọn-ẹ abẹ, arenga achina k'okhubha kw'anọng anarukhi.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Iwa Zadọk obiro owobha mẹ, ttara abaLẹvi biphyir p'am-atzini Ẹkkọhbhi ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi. Wa bẹ abera Ẹkkọhbhi nda ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi k'irerek. Abiyata osi njafọhni maa anọng mba, atte odedenmon nwa ọbọhk.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Ọvaarnọng oben Zadọk bi, “Tzima Ẹkkọhbhi nda ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi akpa nnam k'odedenmon. Idikha kaam ngaam ọphyaam k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kẹ ótzim-m otzima mkpa nnam ma. Kẹ óbiro osi-m nne Ẹkkọhbhi nda ore, ọmaana irukhabe sẹ. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Yina, idikha obeni bi, ‘Ettem kaam kẹdaami ttar-ọ,’ kkeri, kaam nkk'for nda; tte osi-m mach'ọdaakh-ẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Iwa ọvaarnọng obiro oben Zadọk kw'ode ọfọhnẹja bi, “Kwẹ kọ kọttaan o? Kpa nnam k'odedenmon ttara ẹdaa chaam. Tzima Ahimaz kw'ode nnwa kwọ, ọmaana Jonatan kw'ode nnwa kw'Abiyata akpa nnam. Kọ ọmaana Abiyata, bọng dima va pabọng afa akpa nnam. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Kaam ńwobha ndik, k'ibe s'anọng am-arenga ajekha achina k'ibe s'anọng anarukhi, maa atzọhm-m ẹkkaabha.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Mando kw'iwa Zadọk ọmaana Abiyata atzim Ẹkkọhbhi nda ch'Echekhi ch'Ibinọkpaabyi akpa nnam, atza awobha ka Jẹrusalẹm.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Yina, wa Devid ochina ororo om-ovura Egbegbeho ch'Oliv. Wa obubha ọttọhk k'eho, otzima mmo-dukhi om-obhom ẹmọng otzima orenga. Anọng biphyir p'awobh ttar-ẹ abira abubha nho sabẹ, am-abhom amọng atzima avura egbegbeho. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Mada bẹ akk'Devid agbaakha bi, “Ahitophẹl obiro ode wani k'ottem kw'anọng p'asi mphaari-tzama ttara Absalọm.” Mando kwa Devid ozi njọhm, oben bi, “O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, si ndọhna s'Ahitophẹl mmakhi nde edidingi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Mada Devid opyiri k'egbegbeho ebira, kẹ da anọng am-awobha akpobha Ibinọkpaabyi, wa Hushayi kw'ofon Ark ọtza okhebha Devid kẹ, ọmaana owura-baba kwẹ kw'ọkk'ọjaakhi ttara ọkpọhm k'eho chẹ. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Devid oben-ẹ bi, “Idikha kọ atzọn-m abẹ, kọ áde ẹtzọhkha anang-m. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Yina, idikha akpa nnam k'odedenmon atza aben Absalọm bi, ‘Itta ọvaarnọng, kaam ńde ọtzọhmnọng kwọ. Iwa kaam nde ọtzọhmnọng kw'atte, kaam nna ńde ọtzọhmnọng kwọ.’ Mẹ kw'áfha akkaan-m akhibhi ndọhna s'Ahitophẹl. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Zadọk ọmaana Abiyata p'ade afọhnẹja, áwobh-owobha kẹ ttar-ọ. Gbaak bẹ odik kpenamkpen kw'abhaang k'ẹvaar-ttọhmma. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Va pabẹ p'ijinọng afa p'ade; Ahimaz kwa Zadọk obhoni ọmaana Jonatan kw'Abiyata obhoni, awobh mẹ ttara bẹ. Tzọhm bẹ akwu agbaakh-m odik kpenamkpen kw'abhaang.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Mando kwa Hushayi kw'ode oyok-odikkobh kwa Devid opyiri ka Jẹrusalẹm, k'ogbe kw'Absalọm om-odim k'odedenmon.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Devid ọmaana Ziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Mada Devid okk'orenga ọkwọbha egbegbeho nduma ibebaa, on-ore Ziba kw'ode ọtzọhmnọng kwa Mẹphiboshẹt. Wa ọdabh nwọr-wobha ka nnyanyaang, obiro ọtzọkha brẹd-duk arọbh jobh, ọmaana attukha-pyi arọbh azen p'agrep p'agwu-ogwu, ọmaana attukha-pyi arọbh azen pa fig, okwu ọttara k'atzuk pa bẹ akhe k'ẹkpa cha bẹ atzim etzenkpa asi, otzima otzik Devid.<verse eid="2SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Iwa ọvaarnọng ọbọbh Ziba bi, “Atzim ekpo mbya akwu mbọng o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Ziba obhina bi, “Nnyanyaang nna nde s'ẹhọhmmọr ch'ọvaarnọng ẹyaar e. Brẹd ọmaana achiduk ade p'adikkobh mba áchi. Atzuk mba ábira asi for igaangi ayok p'ẹfa ẹkk'ẹha k'ibe s'anọng anarukhi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Ọvaarnọng ọn-ọbọbh bi, “Nnwa-mmona kw'itta kwọ kho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Ziba oben bi, “Kẹ owobh ka Jẹrusalẹm, okhuri da ochibhi bi, ‘Mayina s'anọng p'Israẹl ánang-m ọvaarbhon kw'otte kwaam kw'ideden, ọnang.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Mẹ wọ, ọvaarnọng oben Ziba bi, “Ọttọhk kpenamkpen fa Mẹphiboshẹt ọkhaam on-ode fọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Ziba oben bi, “Itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, nnak k'ikpokpobha, tte kaam ngaama ọphyaam k'itzitzikha sọ.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shimeyi olukhi Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Mada ọvaar Devid opyiri k'obhon kwa Bahurim, ojinọng wani kw'ofon k'ẹnọmma dani ttara ẹhọhmmọr cha Saul oyin ka, ọttẹwọr ọm-ọgbaak olukhi. Ojinọng nwa okpen Shimeyi, kw'ode nnwa kwa Gẹra. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Wa ọm-ọbhari Devid ọmaana akhaan-nọng p'ọvaarnọng biphyir atza. Iwa agbong-nọng biphyir ọmaana abaabhi awobh Devid k'odimbọhk ọmaana ka kwabọhk. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Wa Shimeyi om-olukhi Devid, oben bi, “Bina ma, rọhng afona! Ọnọng-dama mach-ọ, ọfhu-anọng macha kọ! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkk'ọ ọmmamma ọnanga k'anọng p'afhu k'ẹhọhmmọr cha Saul, kw'atzọk ẹvaar ka mbọhk sẹ adabh. Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'ọvaarbhon nwa ọtzọkha ka mbọhk sọ, ọnang nnwa kwọ Absalọm. Kọ an-awobh k'ihem, okhuri bi, ade ọfhu-anọng!”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Mẹ wọ, Abishayi kw'ode nnwa kwa Zeruya, oben ọvaarnọng bi, “Okhuri yan kw'ọpfa-bukhi nwa om-olukhi, itta ọvaarnọng kwaam o? Tte nda mkpaar-ẹ eho.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Iwa ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Odik nwa on-oreng yan ọkpakha bọbọng va pa Zeruya o? Idikha ode Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ oben-ẹ bi, ‘Lukhi Devid,’ anyi wọ ọfha ọbọbh bi, ‘Okhuri yan kw'am-asi odik nwa o?’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Mando kwa Devid obeni Abishayi ọmaana atzọhmnọng pẹ biphyir bi, “Ojemi nnwa kwa kaam ọkhaam, om-oror nden s'ofhu-m, ọn-ọyọhng oBẹnjamin-nọng nwa o! Bọng ttẹ-ẹ ọbọhk, olukh-m e; Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ ọkk'ẹ obena bi, osi mando. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Asi mẹ, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọfha ore ọmmamma kwaam, on-otzera ilulukhi sa Shimeyi mayina, ttara ẹdaa ch'echekhi chẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Iwa Devid ọmaana atzọhmnọng pẹ, achina ororo am-arenga k'ọkkadeden k'ogbe kwa Shimeyi, obiro orenga k'okhubha kw'egbegbeho kw'okker-ẹ itzitzikha. Om-olukhi Devid, ọbhar-ẹ atza, obiro obhon-ẹ ọkpọhm. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Wa ọvaarnọng ọmaana anọng p'atzọn-ẹ abẹ biphyir, apyiri k'ibe sa bẹ akhami k'ọkhọkhọhni. Mẹ wọ kw'iwa Devid okwok ọwọhng.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndọhna sa Hushayi ọmaana Ahitophẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Iwa Absalọm ọmaana ajinọng p'Israẹl biphyir akk'apyiri ka Jẹrusalẹm. Wa Ahitophẹl obiro ọtzọn-ẹ abẹ okwu. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Oyok-odikkobh kwa Devid kw'okpen Hushayi kw'ofon Ark, ọtza okhebha Absalọm, oben-ẹ bi, “Tte ọvaarnọng oruk akpen p'adum-odum! Tte ọvaarnọng oruk akpen p'adum-odum!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Absalọm ọbọbh Hushayi bi, “Ma wọ ode idadaakha s'afha akhọhkha oyokh-odikkobh o? Bọng areng iyok, osi yan kw'anẹ-ẹ abẹ atzọni afona?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushayi oben Absalọm bi, “Mma e, kaam nwobha ttara ọnọng kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'otzekha. Kẹ wọ ode ọnọng kw'anọng mba ọmaana ajinọng p'Israẹl biphyir akk'atzekha e. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Ọttara bi, anyi kwa kaam nsi ọtzọhm nnang o? Kaam nsi ọtzọhm nnang nnwa kwẹ. Odem nwa kw'iwa nsi nnang atte, mando kwa kaam nsi ọtzọhm nnang-ọ.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Absalọm oben Ahitophẹl bi, “Nang man ndọhna sọ. Mosi yan?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitophẹl obhina Absalọm bi, “Yima akkọra-panọng p'atte abẹ p'okhokhi bi, bẹ akkeri ẹvaar-ttọhmma. Mẹ wọ osi, anọng p'Israẹl biphyir ábhaanga bi, akk'atte idik akpukhi. Anọng p'atzum-ọ mbọhk ka nnam án-abira ado ẹfa akhaama.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Mando kwa bẹ asi ikhira k'ọhohm ebir-ebir, s'Absalọm owobh oyima akkọra-panọng p'otte abẹ, k'itzitzikha s'anọng p'Israẹl biphyir.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />K'ogbe nwuma, iwa ndọhna s'Ahitophẹl nde mach'ọnọng ọdọhni Ibinọkpaabyi. Mando kw'iwa Devid ọmaana Absalọm am-atzọkha ndọhna kpenamkpen s'Ahitophẹl.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ahitophẹl oben Absalọm bi, “Tte ndekha ajinọng nnọhna ẹrọbh obhiri jobh, ndima bẹ ngwubh Devid k'erungiwu cha mayina. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Kaam ńnim-ẹ abẹ, k'ogbe kw'ọkk'ẹ ọkhọhna, ẹfa ebire ẹhẹ-ẹ. Kaam ngẹ-ẹ ojora f'ideden ka for, ifha anọng p'awobh ttar-ẹ, árọbh. Kaam ḿfhu ọvaarnọng kẹ-khẹ, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />ḿbiri ndima anọng mbuma biphyir mkpa nnam nchen-ọ. Obo kw'ọnọng kw'am-aror, óde ekhuna ch'ayok biphyir; anọng mbuma biphyir, áwobha k'odidiri.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Absalọm ọmaana adeden-nọng p'Israẹl biphyir, are mphaari nna mach'odik-ọkka.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Mẹ wọ, Absalọm on-oben bi, “Bọng yeri Hushayi kw'ofon Ark okwu, ifha mobiro ọbhaanga ochibhi kwẹ.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Mada Hushayi opyiri, Absalọm oben-ẹ bi, “Kkeri ndọhna s'Ahitophẹl okk'man ọnanga ma e. Mósi mach'ọgbaakh o? Oni mando ode, gbaak man ochibhi kwọ.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushayi e, obhina Absalọm bi, “Ndọhna s'Ahitophẹl ọnangi m'ogbe nwa kinjibhi. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Hushayi oben bi, kọ arong atte ọmaana ajinọng pẹ kẹ; bẹ ade agbong-nọng p'ajor mach'ekye, cha bẹ abọk va ana k'ẹtzam. Ayongi mẹ, atte ode ogbong-nọng kw'ekkoji; kẹ ma kóyima ttara agbong-nọng pẹ m'erungiwu nda. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Madeden nwa, ochubh k'ọmma kw'itzakpa wani, asi mẹ, ochubh k'ibe ọdọdọk. Idikha kẹ ochi eden orima agbong-nọng pọ abẹ, ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ọbhaang kwẹ, óben bi, ‘Ẹnọng-fha ẹkk'ẹbara kpọng k'ottem kw'agbong-nọng p'atzọni Absalọm abẹ.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Mẹ wọ, kaambi ogbong-nọng kw'ọbari ettem mach'ekye wọ, ojora ọnẹ-ẹ ẹfa maa, ope ka for biphyir, okhuri bi, anọng p'Israẹl biphyir arong bi, atte ode ogbong-nọng. Anọng p'abira awobha ttar-ẹ ade akkenggitza.<verse eid="2SA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />“Kẹ wọ osi, ndọhna saam nde bi, kkeri anọng p'Israẹl biphyir, ttẹwọr k'ẹkhọma cha Dan maa, apyiri k'ẹkhọma cha Beershẹba, kkeri odem nwa kwa bẹ ahaabhi mach'oyeyeng kw'ẹraanga-kha, tte bẹ biphyir awobha ttar-ọ. Kọ ọkhaam atzima bẹ eden atza egbong. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Ibe kpenamkpen sa mọfha ore atte, mórim-ẹ abẹ. Mokwuri kẹ nkwuri mach'eboni ebubh irerek. Kẹ akpen kóruk, ojinọng manda wani kwẹ kw'órik kode. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Idikha ọrọbhi odim k'odedenmon, anọng p'Israẹl biphyir átzima ndik atzọr nchumi s'obhon nwuma abhari k'ẹttẹri, maa itzatzaa manda wani kw'orik kóde.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Mando kw'Absalọm ọmaana ajinọng p'Israẹl biphyir abeni bi, “Ndọhna sa Hushayi kw'ofon Ark njibhi ọtzam nyọhnga s'Ahitophẹl.” Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkk'ọkhama bi, opfuri ndọhna ọkkakka s'Ahitophẹl, ifha otte itzama ọbọhk ikhebha Absalọm.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Iwa Hushayi oben Zadọk ọmaana Abiyata p'ade afọhnẹja bi, “Ahitophẹl okk'Absalọm ọmaana adeden-nọng p'Israẹl ọtzọhna eden cha bẹ asi. Yina, kaam nkk'bẹ eden ọdọdọk ndọhna cha bẹ asi. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Tzọhm ẹkkaabha m'ẹbaa nda achena Devid bi, ‘Kọ k'ibe s'anọng am-arenga ajekha achina k'ibe s'anọng anarukhi m'erungiwu nda, kàtaabha. Yina, echuni kakhaama bi, ajekha k'okhubha. Oni mando ode, ọvaarnọng ọmaana anọng biphyir p'awobh ttar-ẹ, bẹ ábọkha bẹ, afhu-ofhu.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Iwa Jonatan ọmaana Ahimaz awobh k'Ẹn-Rogẹl, da iwa bẹ an-arori bi, anọng are bi bẹ am-adim k'odedenmon. Wa ominanwa wọ ọm-ọtza ọgbaak bẹ idik, yina bẹ-bẹ an-atza agbaak ọvaar Devid. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Yina, wa odikkobh wani ore bẹ, ọtza ọgbaak Absalọm. Mando kwa bẹ arọbhi ẹbhar-ẹbhar, achina k'ọhọhm kw'ojinọng wani ka Bahurim, kw'ọkhaam esipe k'ettọhmmattem chẹ. Wa bẹ ahakha achubha k'esipe ẹtzaanga. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Mando kwa kwanọng kw'ẹttọhmma nda ọtzọk ọttọhk obubha esipe nda, obiro ọtzọkha abọkpa-mọma ọyaan mẹ. Wa ọnọng kw'orong bi, ajinọng mba achubh mẹ kode.<verse eid="2SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Mada ajinọng p'Absalọm akwu akhebha kwanọng nwa m'ọhọhm, bẹ abọbh-ẹ bi, “Ahimaz ọmaana Jonatan awobh man?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Kwanọng nwa obhina bẹ bi, “Bẹ ajek k'okhubha nwonggo kw'ekhekha e.” Wa ajinọng mba aror bẹ, yina, bẹ ọnọng kare. Mando kwa bẹ akpa nnam ka Jẹrusalẹm.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Mada ajinọng mba akk'afona, Ahimaz ọmaana Jonatan ayin k'esipe, atza agbaak ọvaar Devid odik nwa. Bẹ aben bi, “Do for ẹbhar-ẹbhar ajekha k'ọraanga okhubha; kkeri Ahitophẹl okk'bẹ ọtzọhna odem kwa bẹ asi.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Mẹ wọ, Devid ọmaana anọng biphyir p'awobh ttar-ẹ abina orenga, ajekha k'okhubha kwa Jọrdan. Yina ewu ehobha, anọng korikhi kw'oni Jọrdan ajekha.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Mada Ahitophẹl ore bi, bẹ ndọhna s'ọnangi bẹ katzọk, ọyaar ẹnyanyaang chẹ ọbhana k'obhon kwẹ. Odo ẹhọhmmọr chẹ biphyir, obina ọtza ọgbana edik. Ofona mẹ, wa ope, bẹ anọhng-ẹ k'epekhubh ch'otte.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Mẹ wọ, Devid obina ochina k'obhon kwa Mahanayim. Wa Absalọm obiro otzima ajinọng p'Israẹl biphyir ojekha k'okhubha kwa Jọrdan. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Wa Absalọm okk'Amasa ọrọbha mach'oho kw'agbong-nọng, otzima otzer eho cha Joab. Wa Amasa ode nnwa kw'ojinọng kw'okpen Jẹtẹr kw'ofon Ishmayẹl, kw'ọtzọk Abigẹl kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kwa Nahash obiro ode ọgbaanotte kwa Zeruya kw'ode ọkka kwa Joab. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Anọng p'Israẹl ọmaana Absalọm abhing k'ẹkhọma ch'anọng pa Gilead.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Mada Devid opyiri k'obhon kwa Mahanayim, Shobi kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Nahash, kw'ofon Raba k'ẹkhọma ch'Ammọn, ọmaana Makir kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kw'Amiyẹl kw'ofon Lo-Debar, ttara Barzilayi kw'ofon Rogẹlim k'ẹkhọma cha Gilead <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />atzima ekpo py'eyima, ọmaana agbang-gbang, ttara ibanga-rọhkha. Bẹ abira atzima wit ọmaana abarli, ọmaana abubuma, ọmaana abọkpa-bhaabha, ọmaana ngirigiri ttara achen-meni. <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />Bẹ atzima akhọkhọhnana, ọmaana abasi p'akk'agaangi, ọmaana arukhimaan, ọmaana abukpa p'afon k'abasi p'andamogbodo achena Devid ọmaana anọng pẹ bi, bẹ achi. Bẹ aben bi, “Anọng mba okk'bẹ ọkhọhna, okwo ọkhaama bẹ, asi abira adaak bẹ, k'ibe s'anọng anarukhi.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Obo kw'Absalọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Wa Devid otzobha ajinọng p'awobh ttar-ẹ, osi ayok bani adenho p'agbong-nọng nnọhna-nnọhna, bani adenho p'agbong-nọng arọbh azen-azen. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Devid ọbhaangi agbong-nọng mba ka ngaan nttaan, osi Joab odenho kw'ẹkhaan dani. Osi Abishayi kw'ode nnwa kwa Zeruya, kw'obiro ode ọgbaanotte kwa Joab odenho kw'ẹkhaan dani. Osi Ittayi kw'ofon Git odenho kw'ẹkhaan dani. Wa ọvaarnọng oben ajinọng mba bi, “Kaam ọkhaam ḿbiri ndọn bọng abẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Yina, ajinọng mba aben bi, “Itta, kọ k'iyaan kakhaambi ayin. Idikha mọrọbhi, man attattaanganọng odik kọkpakha. Idikha man ibhaakha rani ope, man bẹ odik kọkpakha. Yina, kọ abari odik ayọhnga man anọng nnọhna ẹrọbh obhiri nzen. Kẹ wọ osi ọbaana bi, kọ awobha m'odedenmon, atzọhm man ẹkkaana e.” <verse eid="2SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Iwa ọvaarnọng on-obhina bi, “Kaam ńsi odik kpenamkpen osi kwa bọng are bi, ojibh-ojibh.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Mẹ wọ, iwa ọvaarnọng obe k'ẹbaakhamma ọkhaan-ọkhaan, mada ajinọng mba abin attọma ka ngaan s'arọbh azen-azen, ọmaana ka ngaan sa nnọhna-nnọhna, afona. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Wa ọvaarnọng ọtzọr Joab, ọmaana Abishayi ttara Ittayi itzọhng bi, “Bọng nenga kaam abẹ, ayobh odikkobh nwuma Absalọm oyobh o.” Wa agbong-nọng biphyir abhaanga da ọvaarnọng ọm-ọtzọr adenho itzọhng okhuri Absalọm.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Iwa agbong-nọng attọma ẹkhaan ayin k'odedenmon, atza arima anọng p'Israẹl abẹ. Wa egbong nda ewobh k'ẹtzam ch'Ephraim. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Mẹ kw'iwa ajinọng pa Devid akhem agbong-nọng p'Israẹl. Anọng p'ape ewu nduma ahaabhi apyiri nnọhna arọbh afa obhiri jobh. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Wa erima nda ẹnyaami makhọra ẹkhọma nda biphyir. Ọnọng-mik kw'iwa ope k'ẹtzam, ọyọhng kw'ope k'ọkkangkkaang.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Iwa Absalọm ọtza ottema ajinọng pa Devid abẹ. Wa ọm-ọyaar ẹnyanyaang chẹ. Mada ẹnyanyaang nda ereng bi, ẹkwọbha k'irekh-irek kw'echi cha oak ch'ideden, ch'abọhnga pẹ akpa-ọkpa, isisaa s'Absalọm igbaama k'echi nda. Wa ọn-ọyọhn m'ottem kw'ẹrọng ọmaana irerek. Ẹnyanyaang chẹ echina ororo ẹm-ẹrọbh efona.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Mando kw'ojinọng wani kw'ore odik kw'ọkk'ọtta, ofon ọtza ọgbaak Joab bi, “Kaam nne Absalọm da ọyọhni k'echi ch'oak.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Joab oben ojinọng kw'ọgbaakh-ẹ odik nwa bi, “Obi! Are Absalọm o? Osi yan kẹ eden dani kafhu abhari m'irerek? Kaam ira nkk'ọ ashẹkẹl jobh pa silva ọmaana odikpa kw'ọkkakkaama nnanga.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Yina, Joab obhina bi, “Kaambi akhe-m ashẹkẹl p'adọhbhi apyiri nnọhna mfa obhiri arọbh jobh ma mbọhk, kaam nnwa kw'ọvaarnọng ọbọhk kinttọmi e. Mowobh mẹ ọbhaanga da ọvaarnọng ọtzọri kọ, ọmaana Abishayi ttara Ittayi itzọhng bi, ‘Bọng nnenga kaam abẹ, ayobh odikkobh nwuma Absalọm.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Idikha ira kaam nkk'Absalọm mfha, nge akpen paam ka dama-dama, da odik on-ode kw'ọvaarnọng on-om-oronga, ira akk'arọbha aji-m.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Joab oben bi, “Kaam manda dọk kimbe ndikh-ọ.” Mando kw'ọtzọk akhọhn attaan p'otzim ka mbọhk, okhum Absalọm k'ettem, mẹ da Absalọm otzim om-oji iwọhng m'echi ch'oak. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Adikkobh jobh p'ade atzim-egbongkpo pa Joab akhọri Absalọm akhe k'ottem, akyer-ẹ abun afhu.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Mando kwa Joab ogyi obukpọhng, otzima oben agbong-nọng bi, bẹ akwọbha ajinọng p'Israẹl okhukhubh. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Bẹ atzini obukhi kw'Absalọm atza abhari k'ipekhuma s'idong-odong k'ẹtzam. Bẹ atzọkha ọtzakpa-hung abubh-ẹ. M'ogbe nwuma, anọng p'Israẹl biphyir arọbh achina k'ihọhm sabẹ.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />K'ogbe kw'Absalọm otzim orukhi akpen, wa ọtzọk ọtza ottima ebebe k'Ẹttẹri ch'Ọvaarnọng mach'ojima ọnang for sẹ, da iwa ochibhi bi, “Kaam nnwa kw'ijinọng kingaam kw'osi che chaam eningi edimi.” Iwa oyeri ọtza nwa obhina che chẹ. Ọtza nwa okpen Ejima ch'Absalọm maa apyiri k'ewu cha mayina.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devid owobh ka nkwu-osisi sa Absalọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Iwa Ahimaz kw'ode nnwa kwa Zadọk oben bi, “Tte nnọbh nda mgbaak ọvaarnọng ẹkkaabha nda bi, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkk'ẹ ọkkaana ka mbọhk s'attattaanga-nọng pẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Joab oben-ẹ bi, “Kọ arang atza agbaak ẹkkaabha nda mayina. Kọ atza ogbe ọdọdọk, mayina kàtza, okhuri bi, nnwa kw'ọvaarnọng ọkk'ọpa.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Mẹ wọ, Joab oben ọnọng wani kw'ofon Kush bi, “Rọhng atza agbaak ọvaarnọng odik kw'akk'ara.” Ọnọng nwa kw'ofon Kush ọrakha ọnang Joab ikpokpobha, yina ọn-ọrọbhi ofona.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahimaz kw'ode nnwa kwa Zadọk obiro oben bi, “Kaambi ode yan, tzotzokhaan, tte nnọbh ndor ayi nwa kw'ofon Kush nnam.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Kaambi mẹ wọ, Joab obhina bi, “Nnwa kwaam, osi yan kw'aben bi atza? Ẹkkaabha manda dani ch'ẹnang-ọ echora kakhaam.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Oben bi, “Kaambi ode yan, kaam nnọbh nda-ọtza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Mẹ wọ, Joab oben bi, “Rọbh rọhng!” Mando kw'Ahimaz ọrọbhi orenga k'okhubha kw'ẹtteri, on-ochi ọnọng nwa kw'ofon Kush eden.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Mada Devid owobh ẹwọr k'ottem kw'ẹbaakhamma ch'iyaan ọmaana ch'ẹtzaanga, okker-ibe ovura k'ittakhọhnga s'echumi ch'ẹbaakhamma. Mada okkeri k'iyaan, on-ore ojinọng kw'ọm-ọrọbh kẹ mancheni. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Okker-ibe oyeri ọvaarnọng, ọgbaakh-ẹ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Idikha ode mancheni, kw'oyini bi, otzim ẹkkaabha ẹkkakka.” Wa ojinọng nwa kw'ọm-ọrọbh ẹbhar nda, on-odo ọbaang-ọbaanga.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Okker-ibe nwa obiro ore ọnọng ọdọdọk kw'ọm-ọrọbh okwu. Oyeri okker-ẹbaakhamma, oben bi, “Kkeri e, ojinọng ọdọdọk ọm-ọrọbhi okwu mancheni!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Asi mẹ, kẹ obiro otzima ẹkkaabha ẹkkakka.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Okker-ibe oben bi, “Okher-m mana ocheden nwuma ọm-ọrọbh ẹbhar-dem ch'Ahimaz kw'ode nnwa kwa Zadọk.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Kẹ ode ojinọng ọkkakka. Kẹ otzim ẹkkaabha ẹkkakka.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Mando kw'Ahimaz oyeri ọvaarnọng, oben bi, “Itta, okk'ojibha ọnang man e!” Ọrakha ottima itzitzikha k'irerek ọnang ọvaarnọng ikpokpobha, oben bi, “Ẹtzọhnga ewobha ẹnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwọ! Kẹ okk'anọng p'arim itta ọvaarnọng kwaam abẹ okhema.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Ọvaarnọng ọbọbh bi, “Odikkobh nwuma Absalọm orukhi akpen kẹ o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimaz obhina bi, “Mada Joab om-oben bi, ọtzọhm kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ, ọmaana ọtzọhmnọng kw'ọvaarnọng, nne dama-dama kw'ideden, yina, kwẹ kaam kọttaani.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Be ma ọkhaan-ọkhaan, atzik.” Mando kw'ọpaangi obe ọkhaan-ọkhaan.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Mando kw'ọnọng nwuma kw'ofon Kush opyiri, oben bi, “Itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, bhaanga ẹkkaabha ẹkkakka! Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkk'ọ ọkkaana ka mbọhk s'attattaanga-nọng pọ biphyir.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Ọvaarnọng ọbọbh ọnọng nwa kwa Kush bi, “Odikkobh nwuma Absalọm orukhi akpen kẹ o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Ọnọng nwa kwa Kush obhina bi, “Tte attattaanga-nọng p'itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, ọmaana anọng biphyir p'akhami bi, asọ-ọ itzama, ade mach'odikkobh nwuma.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Mando kwa for ipe ọvaarnọng. Obina ovura k'ẹmaanggọ-ebira ch'ewobh k'ẹbaakhamma, ọtza obhom ẹmọng. Mada om-ofona, oben bi, “Nnwa kwaam Absalọm o! Nnwa kwaam Absalọm o! Ottu kw'ira kọ ape, kaam wọ ira mpe e! Nnwa kwaam Absalọm o, nnwa kwaam o, nnwa kwaam!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Iwa bẹ agbaak Joab bi, “Ọvaarnọng obhomi amọng kẹ, obiro owobha ka nkwu-osisi s'Absalọm ope e.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Ewu nduma, agbong-nọng biphyir an-akhiri ọdadaami kw'ekhema chabẹ aji. Bẹ an-abhakhi awobha ka nkwu-osisi, da bẹ abhaang bi, “Ọvaarnọng owobh ka nkwu-osisi sa nnwa kwẹ kw'ope.” <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />M'ewu nduma, ajinọng mba abẹkhi atza adim k'odedenmon mach'ajinọng pa mgbar nsi, da bẹ arọbhi k'egbong. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Ọvaarnọng obubha mbọhk k'itzitzikha, obhom ẹmọng k'ẹrọng, oben bi, “Nnwa kwaam Absalọm o! Absalọm o! Nnwa kwaam o! Nnwa kwaam!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Mando kwa Joab ọtza odim k'ọhọhm kw'ọvaarnọng oben-ẹ bi, “Kọ akk'ajinọng pọ biphyir aha ka mgbar mayina, p'akkaan akpen pọ, ọmaana akpen pa va pọ p'ijinọng ọmaana p'ipanọng, ọmaana akpen pa panọng pọ, ttara p'akkọra-panọng pọ. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Kọ ahọk attattaanga-nọng pọ idadaakha, attaanga anọng p'akhọhkh-ọ idadaakha. Kọ akk'ẹjaakhi asa mayina bi, adenho p'agbong-nọng ọmaana agbong-nọng pabẹ, ọttọhk kape k'itzitzikha sọ. Kaam nkk'nna k'ewu cha mayina bi, ira ọdaam-ọ ọdaam, ira man biphyir ope, Absalọm oruk akpen. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Bina atza akhe anọng pọ ottem-bara. Kaam nchekhi ka che ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bi, idikha ani k'iyaan ayini afona, yina erungi epyi, ojinọng manda wani kwọ kw'oyima ma ttar-ọ kóde. Itzama nna íyọhnga, idik-ttama kpenamkpen s'ikk'itta ikhebh-ọ k'akpen, ttẹwọr k'edikkobh chọ maa apyiri ma.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Mẹ wọ e, ọvaarnọng obina ọtza owobha ẹwọr k'ẹbaakhamma. Mada bẹ agbaakhi anọng mba bi, Ọvaarnọng owobh ẹwọr k'ẹbaakhamma e, bẹ biphyir afona atza akhebh-ẹ kẹ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2SA 19:8">Devid ọkpa nnam ka Jẹrusalẹm</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">M'ogbe nwuma, anọng p'Israẹl akk'arọbha achina k'ihọhm sabẹ. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Makhọra ngọma s'Israẹl, anọng biphyir am-akhaanga ayok atzim, aben bi, “Ọvaarnọng wọ iwa ọkkaan man ka mbọhk s'attattaanga-nọng paman. Kẹ wọ iwa obiro ọrọbha man ka mbọhk s'anọng pa Philistiya. Yina, kẹ ọkk'ọrọbha oji obhon okhuri Absalọm. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Ma, Absalọm kw'iwa mobyengi ana k'eho bi, ọdabh man, ọkk'ọpa k'egbong-dam. Osi yan kwa bọng amyi manda, bọng ọvaarnọng kabeni ọkpa nnam o?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Ọvaar Devid ọtzọhm ẹkkaabha ochena Zadọk ọmaana Abiyata p'ade afọhnẹja bi, “Bọng bọbh adeden-nọng pa Juda bi, mada idik sa bẹ am-agbaak makhọra Israẹl ikk'ọvaarnọng ipyiri k'ẹttọhmma chẹ, ‘Orenga yan bọng an-ade akponga-nnam-nọng p'atzim ọvaarnọng akpa nnam k'ẹvaar-ttọhmma chẹ o? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Bọng ade afona-nọng paam, mode izi rani. Mẹ wọ, okhuri yan kwa bọng án-ade akponga-nnam-nọng p'ákwu bi, átzima ọvaarnọng abhana o?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Bọng ben Amasa bi, ‘Kọ mode izi rani, mobiro ode efona dani. Tte Ibinọkpaabyi osi-m k'eden kpenamkpen ch'ẹdaakh-ẹ, idikha nnọ-ọ odenho kw'agbong-nọng paam nsi k'akpen pọ biphyir, ndima ndera eho cha Joab.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Iwa odebh nttem s'ajinọng pa Juda biphyir, osi bẹ akhaama ochibhi wani. Bẹ atzọhm ẹkkaabha anang ọvaarnọng aben bi, “Kọ ttara ajinọng pọ biphyir, bọng kpa nnam.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Mando kw'ọvaarnọng ọkpa nnam, okwu opyiri k'Ọraanga kwa Jọrdan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:15">Anọng pa Juda akk'akwa k'obhon kwa Gilgal bi, bẹ akwu akhebha ọvaarnọng mẹ, ifha bẹ atzima ọvaarnọng ajekha Jọrdan. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimeyi kw'ode nnwa kwa Gẹra, kw'ofon k'obhon kwa Bahurim k'ẹkhọma cha Bẹnjamin, otzima ajinọng pa Juda obina ẹbhar-ẹbhar, ọtza okhebha ọvaar Devid. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Anọng nnọhna mfa obhiri arọbh jobh pa afon Bẹnjamin bọ iwa atzọn-ẹ abẹ. Wa Ziba kw'ode ọtzọhmnọng kw'ẹhọhmmọr cha Saul, ọmaana va pẹ p'ijinọng chi, ttara atzọhmnọng ẹrọbh abira awobha ttar-ẹ. Wa bẹ adukh-odukha ahakha ka Jọrdan, kẹ da ọvaarnọng owobh. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Bẹ atzima ẹhọhmmọr ch'ọvaarnọng arenga k'ibe s'anọng am-arenga ajekha, ajekha k'okhubha. Bẹ abira asi odik kpenamkpen kw'ọvaarnọng ochibhi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Mada ọvaarnọng om-odo for s'ojekha Jọrdan, Shimeyi kw'ode nnwa kwa Gẹra, oruri m'irerek m'itzitzikha s'ọvaarnọng, <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />oben-ẹ bi, “Tte itta kwaam, oning-m oponga-pyibha ọnangi. Kọ ottotto kwa khaam ọtzọhmnọng k'ewu ch'iwa kọ itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, abin ka Jẹrusalẹm, kajima. Tte ọvaarnọng oningi odik nwa k'ettem okhe. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Kkeri kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ nnong bi, nkk'ẹkhọhngkwuri nsa. Yina, nkk'nkwa mayina mach'ocheden-nọng kw'ofon ka ngọma sa Josẹph bi, nkwu ngebha itta ọvaarnọng kwaam.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Mẹ wọ, Abishayi kw'ode nnwa kwa Zeruya oben bi, “Shimeyi ọbaan k'obo m'odik nwa e. Kẹ olukhi ọnọng kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'ana obyengi k'eho.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Devid obhina bi, “Bọbọng va pa Zeruya, odik nwa on-oreng yan ọkpakha bọng o? Bọng ẹfa kakhaam bi, bọng akhe ittattaanga m'odik nwa. Ọbaan kẹ bi, bẹ afhu ọnọng m'Israẹl mayina o? Kaam nnong kẹ bi, kaam wọ nde ọvaarnọng kw'Israẹl, mayina e.” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Mẹ wọ, ọvaarnọng ochekhi ọtzọkha ọnwọhngi, oben Shimeyi bi, “Kọ kápe e.”<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Iwa Mẹphiboshẹt kw'ode nnwa-mmona kwa Saul obiro ọtza okhebha ọvaarnọng. Wa mmo sẹ kogbobhi, agba-phyubha kobiro ophyiri, ọbara fa for kogbobhi, tzọni k'ewu ch'ọvaarnọng ofon, maa apyiri k'ewu ch'ọkpa nnam k'odidiri. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Mada ofon ka Jẹrusalẹm bi, okwu okhebha ọvaarnọng, ọvaarnọng ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Mẹphiboshẹt, okhuri yan kw'iwa ana-m abẹ atzọni afona o?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Oben bi, “Itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, mada kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ ndumi-mbọhbhi, nna ben bi, ‘Kaam ńdabh ẹwọr-wobha ka ẹnyanyaang chaam, ḿbiri nyaar chẹ, ifha ndọn ọvaarnọng abẹ mofona.’ Iwa Ziba kw'ode ọtzọhmnọng kwaam, wọ ọbọr-m. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Okk'kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ idik obubha, ọnang kọ itta ọvaarnọng kwaam. Itta ọvaarnọng kwaam ode mach'orenga-eden kw'Ibinọkpaabyi. Si odik kw'are bi, ojibh-ojibh ọnang-ọ. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Iwa va pa va p'otte kwaam biphyir abaan-ọbaana k'obo, ka mbọhk s'itta ọvaarnọng kwaam. Yina, atzer anang ọtzọhmnọng kwọ ewobha k'ottem kw'anọng p'achi ọchattọhk k'okpokkoro kwọ. Mẹ wọ, kaam ngaam bọng ẹfa bi, nchina ororo mphyem ọvaarnọng idikh o?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Ọvaarnọng e, oben-ẹ bi, “Odik nwuma dọk kàgbaak. Kaam nkk'kọ ọmaana Ziba ẹfa nnanga bi, bọng atza akkema irerek sa Saul anang for sabọng.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mẹphiboshẹt oben ọvaarnọng bi, “Mada itta ọvaarnọng kwaam okk'okhuna k'odidiri. Tte kẹ ọtzọkha ọttọhk kpenamkpen biphyir.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Wa Barzilayi kw'ofon k'ẹkhọma cha Gilead obiro obina k'obhon kwa Rogẹlim okwu bi, ọtzọn ọvaarnọng abẹ ojekha Jọrdan, ifha obiro orikh-ẹ k'eden. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Iwa Barzilayi ọkk'ọn-ọtzama kpọng, da iwa on-ode cho arọbh ana. Wa obiro ode ọkkakkaa, kw'okkeri ọvaarnọng k'ogbe kw'owobh k'obhon kwa Mahanayim. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Ọvaarnọng oben Barzilayi bi, “Tzọhn-m abẹ mojekha ka Jẹrusalẹm. Kaam ńkker-ọ okkeri.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Yina, Barzilayi obhina ọvaarnọng bi, “Da kaam ḿbiri nnuk akpen ka cho aphaang, kw'ira kaam nna ńdọn ọvaarnọng abẹ nchina ka Jẹrusalẹm o? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Kaam nna nde cho arọbh ana. Na kaam mbiri mfha nnonga odik kw'ojibh-ojibh ọmaana kw'on-ojibh o? Kaam ọdadaami ọmaana ọmmamma dọk kinnọng. Ọtzọhmnọng kwọ idadaama s'ẹchakpo ttara itzuk dọk kọphaang. Amọng p'akkọhn-amọng p'ijinọng ọmaana p'ipanọng dọk kimmaang. Ka yan kw'ọtzọhmnọng kwọ, on-obiro okwu ọttara kọ itta ọvaarnọng kwaam ẹtzọhkha o? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Kaam k'echora nda ch'ọvaarnọng kimbaan. Ọtzọhmnọng kwọ okhinggẹ ọ́tzọhn ọvaarnọng abẹ ojekha ka Jọrdan ibebaa, orikh-ẹ k'oden-gwuma. <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Tte ọtzọhmnọng kwọ ọkpa nnam e, ifha mpe k'obhon kwaam mbaanga epekhubh s'otte ttara ọkka kwaam e. Yina, kkeri ọtzọhmnọng kwọ Kimham ma. Tte kẹ ọtzọn itta ọvaarnọng kwaam abẹ ojekha k'okhubha. Si kpenamkpen f'achibhi bi asi, anang-ẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Kimham ójekha ttar-m. Kaam ńsi kpenamkpen fa nchibhi nnang-ẹ. Ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'ábira aror, kaam ńsi-osi nnang-ọ.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Mẹ wọ, anọng biphyir ọmaana ọvaarnọng ajekha ka Jọrdan. Ọvaarnọng e, ọbaakha Barzilayi obiro ọsẹ-ẹ ittabọhng. Mando kwa Barzilayi ọkpa nnam ọbhana k'obhon kwẹ.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Mada ọvaarnọng ojek k'okhubha kwa Gilgal, Kimham ọtzọhn-ẹ abẹ ojekha. Asoja pa Juda biphyir ọmaana ibhaakha rani s'agbong-nọng p'Israẹl akk'ọvaarnọng atzima ajekha k'okhubha.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Ogbe kobhiri, ajinọng p'Israẹl biphyir am-akwu k'ọvaarnọng, akwu aben-ẹ bi, “Osi yan kwa votte paman pa Juda afhu ọvaarnọng atzim-ẹ ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr chẹ, ọttara ajinọng pa Devid biphyir ajekha Jọrdan afona o?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Iwa ajinọng pa Juda biphyir abhina ajinọng p'Israẹl bi, “Iwa mosi mando okhuri bi, ọvaarnọng mode anọng bani. Mbọng vọ on-ode ittemdọkhiji sabọng o? Mokk'ọttọhk manda vani f'ọvaarnọng ọtzọkha ochi o? Mokk'ọttọhk manda vani ọtzọkha ọnang for saman o?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Mẹ wọ, ajinọng p'Israẹl an-abhina ajinọng pa Juda bi, “Maman ọkhaam ngọma jobh m'ẹvaar nda ẹ, mẹ wọ, mọkhaam Devid ọtzam ọyọhnga bọng e. Osi yan kwa bọng arẹkhi man manda o? Maman arang iwa ode acheden-nọng oben bi, ọvaarnọng kwaman ọkpa nnam.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Kaambi mẹ wọ, ajinọng pa Juda achina ororo agbana odik nwa.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Shẹba okhe Devid ẹkhọhr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Iwa ọkhọkhọra wani owobh mẹ kw'okpen Shẹba kw'ode nnwa kw'ijinọng kwa Bikiri, kw'ofon k'ẹkhọma cha Bẹnjamin. Wa ogyi obukpọhng, ọkpẹbh oben bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Maman ekkema ka Devid kọkhaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">man ekkema ka nnwa kwa Jẹsẹ kọkhaam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Anọng p'Israẹl o, ọnọng-ọnọng ochina k'ọhọhm kwẹ e!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Mando kw'ajinọng p'Israẹl biphyir abin aji Devid, atza atzọn Shẹba kw'ode nnwa kwa Bikiri, abẹ. Yina, ajinọng pa Juda ttẹwọr ka Jọrdan maa, apyiri ka Jẹrusalẹm, abe k'okhubha kw'ọvaarnọng.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Mada Devid okhun k'ẹvaar-ttọhmma chẹ ka Jẹrusalẹm, ọtzọkha akkọra-panọng pẹ jobh p'okk'ofona oji bi, bẹ akkeri ẹvaar-ttọhmma, ohok k'ọhọhm wani, ọtzọkha bẹ ohok k'irekh-irek kw'abaabhi. Iwa om-okkeri bẹ, yina, bẹ abẹ koyim. Iwa panọng mba awobh m'ibe rani mach'apopa maa, bẹ ape.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Iwa ọvaarnọng oben Amasa bi, “Tzima iwu ittaan ayeri ajinọng pa Juda ttara kọ ọkhaam, bọng akwu.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Yina, mada Amasa ofon bi, otza oyeri ajinọng pa Juda, okponga kẹ maa, ogbe kw'ọvaarnọng ọkk'ẹ ọkha, ọkwọbha.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Mẹ wọ ẹ, Devid on-oben Abishayi bi, “Kker e, itzama sa Shẹba kw'ode nnwa kwa Bikiri ósi man, íyọhnga s'iwa Absalọm osi e. Kọ tzima ajinọng p'itta kwọ akhubh-ẹ. Oni mando ode, kẹ óre idedenmon s'igaang-ọgaangi ore, ọtza ochubha mẹ, ọnaanga man.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Mando kw'ajinọng pa Joab, ọmaana anọng pa Kẹrẹt ọmaana anọng pa Pẹlẹt, ttara akkenggitza biphyir, atzori ka ndọhna s'Abishayi kw'ode odenho, afona. Wa bẹ abina ka Jẹrusalẹm akhubh Shẹba, kw'ode nnwa kwa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Mada bẹ awobh k'ẹtzakpa ch'ideden ka Gibeọn, Amasa okwu okhebha bẹ mẹ. Wa Joab ọfọr egbong-nya chẹ, ọkpa mkpasin k'erin kw'ọdabhi imaana s'ijaabhi nnam mfa s'okhe k'ọpa. Mada oreng bi ochina ororo, sẹ irọbha k'ọpa itto.<verse eid="2SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Joab oben Amasa bi, “Ọgbaanotte kwaam, ọsọ-ọ yan?” Joab otzima odimbọhk kwẹ ọbọkha Amasa k'agba-phyubha mach'oben bi, ọbaakh-ẹ ọbaakha. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Amasa otzum kokhe k'imaana sa Joab otzim k'ọbọhk. Joab okhum-ẹ imaana nnuma k'ẹbhọr maa, abhọri ayin atto m'irerek. Okhum-ẹ ogbe nwuma wani kẹ-khẹ, Amasa ope. Mẹ wọ, Joab ọmaana ọgbaanotte Abishayi akhubh Shẹba kw'ode nnwa kwa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Iwa ojinọng wani k'ottem kw'anọng pa Joab, obe Amasa k'ẹbhabhaanga, oben bi, “Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'orong bi, owobh ka Joab ọmaana ka Devid, tte ọtzọn Joab abẹ!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa oyim ọbangi m'izi sẹ m'eden-ttem. Ojinọng nwa on-ore bi, agbong-nọng biphyir am-atza abe mẹ. Mada ore bi ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'opyiri m'ibe s'Amasa oyim, om-ọpaangi obe, ọn-ọtzọr Amasa obina k'eden orur-ẹ k'owoni wani, ọtzọkha ibara obubh-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Mada bẹ akk'Amasa atzini abina k'eden, ajinọng biphyir afona atza atzọn Joab abẹ bi, bẹ akhubh Shẹba kw'ode nnwa kwa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Shẹba ọkpaanga ngọma s'Israẹl biphyir maa, opyiri k'Abẹl Bẹt-Maka, obiro ọkpaanga ẹkhọma ch'anọng pa Bikiri p'iwa atzobh for sabẹ, atzọn Shẹba abẹ. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Agbong-nọng biphyir p'atzọni Joab abẹ, akwu akhọri Shẹba akhe k'ottem k'Abẹl Bẹt-Maka. Bẹ ayaabha igbo atzima abọkha iyaan-iyaan kw'echumi ch'odedenmon. Bẹ am-akhonga bi, avọhkhi echumi nda. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Yina, kwanọng wani kw'odongi-odongi owobha k'odedenmon ọkpẹbh bi, “Bọng yonga itzọhng e! Bọng yonga itzọhng e! Bọng yeri Joab orenga ọbaang-m, ifha ḿgbaakh-ẹ atzim.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Joab orenga otzor-ẹ ka for, kwanọng nwa ọbọbh-ẹ bi, “Kọ wọ ade Joab o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Obhina bi, “Kaam wọ e.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Kwanọng nwa oben-ẹ bi, “Yong itzọhng abhaanga odik kwa kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ ngaam bi, ọgbaak.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Oben-ẹ bi, “Kaam mminyong itzọhng e.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Kwanọng nwa ochina ororo oben bi, “Iwa anọng am-aben bi, ‘Ọkk'ọha kwẹ ode bi, abeni bi akhaama ebhina, china k'Abẹl. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Maman bọ ode anọng p'arori ẹmẹm, mobiro ode anọng p'akhaam nnam-ophephe k'Israẹl e. Kọ am-akhonga bi, adimi odedenmon kw'ode ẹranga ch'Israẹl e. Osi yan kwa kọ am-aben bi, adimi ekkema ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi o?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Joab obhina bi, “Tzọmi-tzọmi okponga k'idachen! Tzọmi-tzọmi okponga k'idachen bi, kaam arang ngibhi, ayongi mẹ ndimi obhon! <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Kwẹ mando kode. Ode bi, ojinọng wani kw'okpen Shẹba, kw'ode nnwa kwa Bikiri kw'ofon ka mgbegbeho s'Ephraim, kẹ wọ ọkk'ọbọhk kwẹ ọyaangi bi, obun ọvaar Devid. Bọng anang-m ojinọng nwa wani, kaam ńtte obhon nwa ọbọhk otte.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Kwanọng nwa on-oben Joab bi, “Mọbhari eho chẹ k'ọbaakha okhubha ọnang-ọ.”<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Mando kwa kwanọng nwa oreng makhọra, otza okhebha anọng biphyir ttara adongiji pẹ, bẹ akpaara Shẹba kw'ode nwa kwa Bikiri eho, abhari Joab k'ọbaakha okhubha. Mẹ wọ, Joab ogyi obukpọhng otzima oben anọng pẹ biphyir atte odedenmon nwa ọbọhk, ọnọng-ọnọng ọkpa nnam k'ọhọhm kwẹ. Wa Joab obiro ọkpa nnam k'ọvaarnọng ka Jẹrusalẹm.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akhaan-nọng pa Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Iwa Joab wọ ode odenho kw'agbong-nọng p'Israẹl <char style="it">bi waam</char>; Bẹnaya kw'ode nnwa kwa Jẹhoyada ode odenho kw'agbong-nọng pa Kẹrẹt ọmaana agbong-nọng pa Pẹlẹt. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoniram ode oho kw'asi-itzọhm. Jehoshaphat nnwa kw'Ahilud ode ọkkẹr-idik s'ikk'itta. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sheva ode ọkkẹri; Zadọk ọmaana Abiyata ade afọhnẹja. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Iwa Ira kw'ofon Jair ode ọfọhnẹja kwa Devid.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Devid otzuk odik kwa Saul osi anọng pa Gibeọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />K'ogbe kw'iwa Devid ọdabhi ẹvaar, wa okwo f'ideden owobh ka cho manda attaan. Wa Devid oror itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'odik nwa. Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben bi, “Okwo mva oreng k'osisi kwa Saul, ọmaana ẹnọmma chẹ, da bẹ afhu anọng pa Gibeọn.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Ọvaarnọng oyeri anọng pa Gibeọn, ọgbaak bẹ atzim. (Wa anọng pa Gibeọn Israẹl kafon, bẹ ade anọng p'Amọr p'arikhi. Wa anọng p'Israẹl akk'achekhi bi, bẹ atte bẹ ọbọhk aruk akpen. Yina, Saul ọkham bi ofhu bẹ okhuri eyibhi ch'oyibh-ẹ bi, ọkkaana anọng p'Israẹl ọmaana pa Juda.) <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Devid ọbọbh anọng pa Gibeọn bi, “Mbọng fa kaam ńsi nnang bọng? Yan wọ kwa ńnenga nsi ephyokhi, ifha bọng ádo ekkema ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi?” <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Anọng pa Gibeọn abhin-ẹ bi, “Maman ẹfa kọkhaam bi, moror gol ọmaana silva ka mbọhk sa Saul, obiro ode ẹhọhmmọr chẹ. Maman ẹfa kobiro ọkhaama bi, mofhu ọnọng manda wani k'Israẹl.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Devid on-obiro ọbọbh bi, “Mbọng fa bọng arori bi, nsi nnang bọng o?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Bẹ abhina ọvaarnọng bi, “Ọnọng nwuma kw'odimi man, ọkhami bi odimi man biphyir-phyir, man ibe manda rani k'ẹkhọma ch'Israẹl kọkhaam. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Tte bẹ anang man va pa va pẹ p'ijinọng azenamfa mofhu, mọjana abukhi pabẹ k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ka Gibea kw'ode obhon kwa Saul, kẹ nwuma kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'otzekha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Mẹ wọ, ọvaarnọng oben bi, “Kaam ńtte bẹ ọbọhk otte ńnang bọng e.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Wa ọvaarnọng otte Mẹphiboshẹt kw'ode nnwa kwa Jonatan, kw'ode nnwa kwa Saul ọbọhk oruk akpen, okhuri ọnwọhngi kwa Devid ọmaana Jonatan kw'ode nnwa kwa Saul, akk'atzọkha k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Yina, ọvaarnọng ọtzọkha Armoni ọmaana Mẹphiboshẹt, p'ade va p'Aiya kw'ode nnwa kwa Rizpa ọmaani ọnang Saul. Obiro ọtzọkha va p'ijinọng azen pa Mẹrab kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kwa Saul, p'ọmaani ọnang Adriyẹl kw'ode nnwa kwa Barzilayi kw'ofon Mẹhola. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Ọtzọkha bẹ ọnang anọng pa Gibeọn, p'afhu bẹ abira ajana abukhi pabẹ k'egbegbeho, k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Bẹ anọng azenamfa biphyir ape ogbe wani. Wa bẹ afhu bẹ k'echedenwu ch'ipha, da ipha s'abarli im-ittẹwọr.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Rizpa kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kw'Aiya ọtzọkha ọbara-bina oruri k'itzakpa ọnang for sẹ. Owobha mẹ ttẹwọr m'ọphagbe maa, ẹrọng efona k'ọrọngkpakpa etzebh abukhi mbuma. Wa osi mando ifha anọnọhna aningi abukhi mba achi k'ẹya, nden s'ẹtzam nningi bẹ mbiri nchi k'erungi. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />K'ogbe kwa bẹ agbaakhi Devid odik kwa Rizpa kw'ode nnwa kw'ikwanọng kw'Aiya, kw'ode ọkkọra-kwanọng kwa Saul ọkk'ọsa, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />Devid ọtza ọtzọkha akhọbhi pa Saul ọmaana pa nnwa kwẹ Jonatan, k'anọng pa Jabẹsh-Gilead. (Wa anọng mba afhu abukhi pabẹ k'ipha sa Bẹt-Shan, kẹ da iwa anọng pa Philistiya akk'bẹ agbana, k'ogbe kwa bẹ akk'Saul afha ka Gilboa). <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Mando kwa Devid ọtza ọtzọkha akhọbhi pa Saul ọmaana pa nnwa kwẹ Jonatan kẹ. Obiro otzobha akhọbhi p'anọng pa bẹ akk'afha abira ajana abukhi pabẹ kẹ.<verse eid="2SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Bẹ anọhnga akhọbhi pa Saul ọmaana pa nnwa kwẹ Jonatan k'epekhubh cha Kish kw'ode otte kwa Saul, ka Zẹla k'ẹkhọma cha Bẹnjamin. Bẹ abira asi odik kpenamkpen kw'ọvaarnọng obeni. Mada bẹ akk'mando asa, Ibinọkpaabyi ọbhaanga njọhm sabẹ s'irerek nna.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgbong s'aPhilistiya arim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Wa anọng p'Israẹl ọmaana pa Philistiya abira arima egbong. Devid otzima anọng pẹ ọhakha, otza orima anọng pa Philistiya abẹ, maa ẹfa ẹhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ishbi-Bẹnọb, nnwa wani k'ottem kwa va pa va pa Rapha, kw'ẹkhọhnma chẹ cha brons, ẹdọhbhi epyiri ẹdọhbh ch'ashẹkẹl arọbh chi, obiro otzima ọkkangkkaang ọbhakwẹ kw'ọkpa k'erin, oben bi, kẹ ofhu Devid. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Yina, Abishayi nnwa kwa Zeruya okwu ọkkaana Devid. Obun oPhilistiya-nọng nwa, ọfhẹ-ẹ. Ajinọng pa Devid achekhi anang-ẹ bi, “Kọ man abẹ dọk kàtzọn atza egbong, ifha iyaan s'Israẹl iningi idimi.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Okwu opyiri k'ogbe mẹ, egbong ebire etto ọmaana anọng pa Philistiya ka Gọb. M'ogbe nwuma, Sibẹkayi kw'ofon Hushat ofhu Saph, kw'ode nnwa wani k'ottem kwa va pa va pa Rapha.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />K'egbong ẹdọdọk ọmaana anọng pa Philistiya ka Gọb, Ẹlhanan kw'ode nnwa kwa Jair kw'ofon Bẹtẹlẹhẹm, ofhu Golayat kw'ofon Git, kw'ọkhaam ọkhọhn kw'ọdọhni mach'echi ch'oyokhi-ekpo.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />K'egbong ẹdọdọk ch'etto ka Gat, wa ọkhaam ojinọng wani kw'ofu <char style="it">bi gbuk</char>, kw'ọkhaam nnọhna nzadani k'ọbọhk kpenamkpen, ọmaana nnọhna nzadani k'obho kpenamkpen, biphyir-phyir wa ọkhaam nnọhna ẹrọbh obhiri nna. Wa obiro ode nnwa-mmona kwa Rapha. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Wa mada olukhi Israẹl, Jonatan kw'ode nnwa kwa Shimeyi kw'ode ọgbaanotte kwa Devid, ọfhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Iwa anọng mba anna ade, va pa va pa Rapha kw'ofon Gat. Wa Devid ọmaana ajinọng pẹ bọ afhu bẹ.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ẹmọng cha Devid ch'ẹtzọhnga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Mada Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkkaan ọrọbha Devid ka mbọhk s'attattaanga-nọng pẹ biphyir, ọmaana ka mbọhk sa Saul, wa ọkkọhn ẹmọng ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Oben bi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">“Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ ode ẹtzakpa chaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:2">obiro ode ichubhabe saam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:2">ọmaana ọkkaan kwaam;<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Ibinọkpaabyi kwaam wọ ode ẹtzakpa chaam, cha kaam nchubh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">ode ọkhọhnkpa ọmaana ẹfa ch'ẹnaanga chaam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Kẹ wọ ode etzumi-nnam chaam, ichubhabe saam ọmaana ọkkaan kwaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">kẹ wọ ọkkaan-m ka mbọhk s'agbagbaana.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />“Kaam nyeri Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ọbaan k'ẹtzọhnga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">kw'ọkk'aam ọkkaana ka mbọhk s'attattaanga-nọng paam.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />“Ebukhaya ch'obo ẹkk'aam ẹbhọri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">nttẹri s'ekhibhi ẹkk'aam ẹfa ẹna.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Ndik s'epekhubh nkk'nyokha ngọr-m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">agbagbara p'obo akk'aam abẹ ayina.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />“Kaam nyeri Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'iyayakhi-dik saam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">Kaam nyeri Ibinọkpaabyi kwaam bi ọkkaan-m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọbhaanga ẹmọng chaam k'ọhọhm kwẹ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">ẹmọng cha mmomi ẹkk'ẹ ẹtta k'itzọhng.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />“Ọyagbin ọfhọni obiro ọkhaama opoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">agbaari p'ọrọngkpakpa anyengi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">bẹ afhọni okhuri idọdọkhi sẹ.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Irorong iyin-ẹ k'ahung-mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">ekpon ch'echi ibe eyin-ẹ k'ẹmma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">akpongkkang abira awọma ekpon mẹ.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Kẹ ọbhaangi ọrọngkpakpa orenga mẹ ọhakha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">eboni ch'epyi <char style="it">bi kaang</char> ewobh ka mmokpatzọkhi sẹ.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Kẹ ovur ka chẹrubim okhur,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">orenga ka mbabaang s'ọphapha okhur.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Otzim orungibanga osi ikhira s'ikhọr-ẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">osi eboni ch'ẹrọng ch'epyi erungi <char style="it">bi kkaang</char> k'ọrọngkpakpa.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />K'ottem kw'ọyaanttaani, k'itzitzikha sẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">akpongkkang p'ekpon awọma.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otto etzum mach'ẹbhaang-kpon k'ọvaarbhon kwẹ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng obiro ọkpẹbh ẹmọng k'ẹrọng.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Kẹ ọtta ayuk, okwuri attattaanga-nọng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">otzima akpongkkang p'awọm ekpon ch'ideden okhubh bẹ.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Ẹmọng ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkpẹbhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">ọwọhng kw'oji k'ahung-mma pẹ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">osi nttẹri s'araanga p'ideden njana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">osi agbaari p'ọyagbin abira atte eje.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />“Kẹ owobh k'ẹrọng, onemi ọbọhk ọbọkh-m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">ọrọbh-m k'asi p'adong-odong, otzima oyin ka.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Kẹ ọrọbh-m ka mbọhk s'ẹfa ch'attattaanga-nọng paam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">ka mbọhk s'attattaanga-nọng paam, p'agaangi ayọhng-m.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Bẹ arim-m abẹ, k'ewu ch'idik ikhebh-m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">kaambi mẹ wọ, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ iwa ode etzumi-nnam chaam.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Kẹ ohokh-m k'ibe s'iwoni-owoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">ọkkaan-m, okhuri da ọdaami ettem ttar-m.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />“Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkk'aam ochora otzor k'etzora chaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">ọkk'aam ochora otzor k'awurada pa mbọhk saam.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Da kaam nkk'ndora ka nden s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">aponga kaam kapyibhi, da nni nnam mkpa mbọra Ibinọkpaabyi kwaam.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Kaam nkk'aphaangi pẹ biphyir nhokha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">kaam nnam kimbiri mkpa mbọra ndọhna sẹ.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Kaam oponga-pyibha k'itzitzikha sẹ kingaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">nkk'for saam ndọra k'ẹkhọngkwuri.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkk'aam ochora k'etzora chaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">ọkk'aam ochora otzor k'awurada paam p'ore.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />“Ọnọng nwuma kw'ọhak eho ọnang-ọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">kẹ wọ kwa kọ ahọk idadaakha sọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">Kọ asi ejibha atzima atzor, ọnọng kw'oni oponga-pyibha ọkhaam.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Ọnọng kw'owur-owur, kẹ kw'akhọhk awurada pọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">yina, ọnọng kw'osi ebibya, kọ asẹ-ẹ ọgbaan.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Kọ akkaan ọnọng kw'okhom for sẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">yina, ahak ọnọng kw'are bi, oge for ewobha.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kọ wọ ade ottwikkaang kwaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ipyerungi saam, in-ide iyaan.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Kọ akkaan-m bi, nnọbh mmaam k'ottem kw'agbong-nọng p'attaang-m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">k'ẹfa ch'Ibinọkpaabyi kwaam, kaam mfha ngwur abaakha pabẹ njekha.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />“Eden ch'Ibinọkpaabyi etzor-otzor:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">Atzim p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi epina kakhaam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Kẹ ode ọkhọhnkpa kw'ọbaabh anọng p'achubh ka kẹ.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Anyi wọ kw'ám-okpobha oyongi Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Anyi wọ ode Ẹtzakpa chaman, oyongi Ibinọkpaabyi o?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Kẹ Ibinọkpaabyi wọ otzim ẹfa chẹ ọbaabh-m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">obiro osi ọbaabha eden chaam.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Kẹ osi mmo saam ngaama ẹfa macha s'ochimi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">osi-m mbe k'obe f'ogor-ogori.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Kẹ okpebhi mbọhk saam erima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">mbọhk saam mfha mmena oyuk kwa brons.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Ẹkkaana chọ ch'anang-m ede ọkhọhnkpa kwaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">ẹkkaana chọ ẹkk'aam ẹsa mbar.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Kọ asi-m nnenga k'ọkkadeden kw'owoni-owoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">mmo-dọhngi kaam kindebh.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />“Kaam ngwubhi attattaanga-nọng paam, mbiri ndimi bẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">nnam kimkpa maa, ndimi bẹ.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Ndimi bẹ biphyir-phyir, bẹ dọk kafha abina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">bẹ an-atto ayim-m ka mmokpatzọkhi.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Kọ anang-m ẹfa ch'egbong oririma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">asi attattaanga-nọng paam, ahakha nho anang-m.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Kọ asi attattaanga-nọng paam arọbh-m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">kaam mbiri ndimi anọng p'attaang-m.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Bẹ abhom aror ẹkkaana, ọnọng kw'ọkkaan bẹ kode.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">Bẹ abhom ayeri Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, bẹ ebhina kobiro ọnang.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Kaam ngokhi bẹ ayọhri mach'ọkpọhm kw'irerek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">nduk bẹ, mbiri mbari bẹ mmo mach'ẹdọdọhbhi cha mkpaanga-den.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />“Kọ akk'aam akkaana ka mbọhk s'idibhon s'irim-m abẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">ahokh-m mach'oho kw'idibhon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Anọng p'iwa nninong an-awobha k'irekh-irek kwaam.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Akhekhennọng awobh k'ojora k'itzitzikha saam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">ogbe kwa bẹ abhaang odik okhuri kaam <char style="it">bi kpaar</char>, bẹ ahakha eho anang-m.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Ẹfa ẹha akhekhennọng mba biphyir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">bẹ afona k'ochubhabe fabẹ, akwu k'opoma.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />“Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi orukhi akpen! Ẹtzọhnga ewobha ẹnang Ẹtzakpa chaam!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Tte abarada awobha anang Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ẹtzakpa chaam, obiro ode Ọkkaan kwaam!<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Kẹ wọ ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'om-otzukha idik k'eho chaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">kẹ ohokhi idibhon bi, iwobha k'irekh-irek kwaam,<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />kẹ wọ ọkkaan-m ka mbọhk s'attattaanga-nọng paam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Kọ atzin-m k'ebe ch'ẹyọhng ch'attattaanga-nọng paam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">akkaan-m ka mbọhk s'ọgbagbaana.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Kẹ wọ osi, kaam ńdọhnga kọ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, k'ottem kw'idibhon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">kaam ńkkọhn amọng ndima ndọhnga che chọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />“Kẹ ọnangi ọvaarnọng kwẹ ngema sa ndeden,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">osi ejibha-barada ọnang nwuma kw'obyengi ana k'eho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">kw'ode Devid ọmaana va pa va pẹ maa, ogbe ode.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Akponga-nnam-dim pa Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Ma wọ ode akponga-nnam-dim pa Devid:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">“Atzim pa Devid kw'ode nnwa kwa Jẹsẹ ọgbaakhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">atzim p'ojinọng kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ọyọhng okk'otzini k'ẹrọng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">ojinọng kw'Ibinọkpaabyi kwa Jekọb, okk'ana obyengi k'eho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">kw'ode okkenggitza kwa bẹ akkọhni k'amọng daman-daam p'Israẹl:<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“Egwugwuma ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ereng ka kaam ẹgbaak atzim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">atzim pẹ awobh-m k'ẹdaak.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Ibinọkpaabyi kw'anọng p'Israẹl ọgbaakhi atzim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Ẹtzakpa ch'anọng p'Israẹl eben-m bi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Ọnọng kw'ọdabhi anọng k'eden ch'etzor-otzor,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">otzim ojora f'Ibinọkpaabyi ọdabh anọng;<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />kẹ ode mach'iyaan s'ekpebha s'ewuchen ẹmaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">k'ekpebha ch'eboni enede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">mach'iyaan s'imaani k'ogbe kw'ẹrọng ekk'ebhiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">ch'esi araraari amen k'irerek.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />“Idikha ira ẹhọhmmọr chaam en-etzori ttara Ibinọkpaabyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">k'odik-ọkka ira kẹ echekhi ch'ipemanitzor, kosi ttar-m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">ira echekhi ch'ọphaari obiro ọbọkha otzima k'ọphaangi kpenamkpen, kosi ttar-m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">k'odik-ọkka kẹ ọkk'ẹnaanga chaam, ọsa eyin k'eden,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">obiro osi idik ọnang-m, otzor k'ochibhi kpenamkpen kwaam.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Yina, abibyanọng ade mach'afhodima, pa bẹ abhari okhubha wani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">da ọnọng oni bẹ ka mbọhk ofha otzima.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ọn-ọgbọhkhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">om-otzima ọtzọhm-ttọhk f'ode okkonga, obiro ọdọhni mach'ẹmma ch'ọkhọhn ọbọkha afhodima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">bẹ akwọmi bẹ biphyir-phyir, k'ibe sa bẹ awobh.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akkenggitza pa Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Ma wọ ode che p'akkenggitza pa Devid:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:8">Ocheden-nọng kw'ode oho k'ottem kw'anọng attaan ode Joshẹb-Bashẹbẹt, kw'ofon Takemọn. Wa kẹ otzim ọkhọhn fẹ orima ajinọng nnọhna mfa abẹ, p'ofhu k'ogbe wani.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Ottong afa ode Ẹleyaza kw'ode nnwa kwa Dodo kw'ofon Aho. Mach'ọnọng wani k'ottem kw'akkenggitza attaan, wa kẹ owobh ttara Devid, k'ogbe kwa bẹ alukhi aPhilistiya p'iwa atzobh ka Pas-Damim bi, arima egbong. Wa agbong-nọng p'Israẹl atzọr akpa nnam, <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />yina, Ẹleyaza obe <char style="it">bi pyiir</char> ofhu aPhilistiya maa, ọbọhk okwokh-ẹ obiro ọpẹ-ẹ, ọraakhi k'ọkkangkkaang. Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang bẹ ekhema ch'ideden m'ewu nduma. Mando kw'agbong-nọng akpa nnam k'Ẹleyaza. Yina, wa on-okhinggẹ orik bi, bẹ awọra anọng p'akk'apa ekpo.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Ottong attaan ode Shama kw'ode nnwa kw'Agi kw'ofon Harar. K'ogbe kw'anọng p'aPhilistiya atzobh k'ibe rani, s'owoni kw'achi-mọma ahaabh-ọhaabh, agbong-nọng p'Israẹl arọbh aji bẹ. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Yina, Shama obe <char style="it">bi pyiir</char> k'ottem kw'owoni nwa, ọkpa anọng p'aPhilistiya eden, ofhu bẹ. Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang bẹ ekhema ch'ideden.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />M'ọphagbe, ajinọng attaan k'ottem kw'oho p'akkenggitza ẹrọbh obhiri jobh, atza akhebha Devid k'ọmma kw'itzakpa kw'Adulam, k'ogbe kw'ẹkhaan ch'anọng p'aPhilistiya ebhingi k'Ẹttẹri cha Rephayim. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />K'ogbe nwuma kwa Devid owobh k'ichubhabe, akkeri-ẹbaakhamma cha Philistiya awobh ka Bẹtẹlẹhẹm. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Wa asi adaak Devid, on-oben bi, “Kpe o, ira ọnọng ọfha ọkhaabha asi k'esipe ch'ẹbaang ẹbaakhamma cha Bẹtẹlẹhẹm, ọnang-m ngwo e!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Mando kw'akkenggitza mbuma attaan amaami m'ibhingabe sa Philistiya, atza akhaabha asi k'esipe ch'ẹbaang ẹbaakhamma cha Bẹtẹlẹhẹm, atzima achena Devid bi, ogwo. Yina, obhum asi mbuma ogwo-ogwo, on-otzer obyengi bẹ m'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, mach'ẹnanga. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Oben bi, “Tzọmi-tzọmi okponga k'idachen, o Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, bi kaam nsi odik-dema nwa! Asi mba abari odik mach'izi s'ajinọng mba p'akhe akpen pabẹ k'obo.” Devid obhum bẹ ogwo-ogwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Mando kw'iwa akkenggitza mbuma attaan asi odik-barada nwa.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishayi kw'ode ọgbaanotte kwa Joab, kw'obiro ode nnwa kwa Zeruya ọmaani, wọ iwa ode oho kwa bẹ anọng attaan. Wa otzim ọkhọhn fẹ orima ajinọng arọbh chi abẹ, ofhu bẹ. Ofona mẹ ọtza che mach'ayok mbonggo attaan. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Wa bẹ anang Abishayi ededen ch'ẹbari ọtzam ẹyọhnga ch'ayok mbonggo attaan. Kẹ on-ode odenho kwabẹ, kaambi ode bi iwa ẹkhaan chabẹ kọttar.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Bẹnaya kw'ode nnwa kwa Jẹhoyada, kw'obiro ode ọkkakaama kw'ofon Kabzil, wa osi idik-barada. Wa ofhu akkenggitza p'ideden afa pa Moab. Obiro ọhakha k'ipekhuma ọtza ofhu ekye k'ewu ch'eboni etzebhi. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Wa kẹ obiro ofhu ọnọng kw'ofon Ijip, kw'ojibhi ojinọng. Chibhi da iwa ojipnọng nwa otzim ọkhọhn fẹ k'ọbọhk, Bẹnaya ọtza orim-ẹ abẹ ttara ochikhura. Ọbọkha ojipnọng nwa ọkhọhn fẹ ọna, otzima ọfhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Idik-barada s'iwa Bẹnaya, kw'ode nnwa kwa Jẹhoyada, osi rọ ma. Wa obiro ọtza che mach-akkenggitza mbonggo attaan. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Wa bẹ an-anang-ẹ ikpokpobha s'iyọhng s'ajinọng mbonggo ẹrọbh obhiri jobh. Yina, wa kẹ k'ẹkhaan ch'anọng mba attaan kọttar. Mando kwa Devid ọsẹ-ẹ odenho kw'abaabhi pẹ.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />K'ottem kw'anọng ẹrọbh obhiri jobh ode:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:24">Asahẹl kw'ode ọgbaanotte kwa Joab,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:24">ọmaana Ẹlhanan kw'ode nnwa kwa Dodo kw'ofon Bẹtẹlẹhẹm,<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />ọmaana Shama kw'ofon Harod,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:25">ọmaana Ẹlika kw'obiro ofona Harod,<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />ọmaana Hẹlẹz kw'ofon Palti,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:26">ọmaana Ira kw'ode nnwa kw'Ikẹsh kw'ofon Tẹkoa,<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />ọmaana Abiyẹza kw'ofon Anatọt,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:27">ọmaana Sibẹkayi kw'ofon Hushat,<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />ọmaana Zalmọn kw'ofon Aho,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:28">ọmaana Maharayi kw'ofon Nẹtophat,<verse eid="2SA 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />ọmaana Hẹlẹb nnwa kwa Baana kw'obiro ofona Nẹtophat,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:29">Ittayi nnwa kwa Ribayi kw'ofon Gibea k'ẹkhọma cha Bẹnjamin,<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Bẹnaya kw'ofon Piraton,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:30">ọmaana Hidayi kw'ofon ka nttẹri sa Gaash,<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />ọmaana Abi-Albọn kw'ofon Arbat,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:31">ọmaana Azmavẹt kw'ofon Barhum,<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />ọmaana Eliyaba kw'ofon Shalbọn kw'ode nnwa kwa Jashẹn, ọmaana Jonatan<verse eid="2SA 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />kw'ode nnwa kwa Shama kw'ofon Harar,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:33">ọmaana Ahiyam kw'ode nnwa kwa Sharar kw'obiro ofona Harar,<verse eid="2SA 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />ọmaana Ẹliphẹlẹt kw'ode nnwa kw'Ahasbayi kw'ofon Maakat,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:34">ọmaana Eliyam kw'ode nnwa kwa Ahitophẹl kw'ofon Gilọn,<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />ọmaana Hẹzro kw'ofon Kaamẹl,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:35">ọmaana Paarayi kw'ofon Arbit,<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igal kw'ode nnwa kwa Natan kw'ofon Zoba, Bani kw'ofon Gad,<verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />ọmaana Zẹlẹk kw'ofon Ammọn,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:37">ọmaana Nahariya kw'ofon Berot, kw'ode otzim-egbongkpo kwa Joab kw'ode nnwa kwa Zeruya,<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />ọmaana Ira kw'ofon Itir,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:38">ọmaana Garẹb kw'obiro ofona Itir,<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />ttara Uriya kw'ofon Het.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 23:39">Biphyir-phyir, wa bẹ ade anọng ẹrọbh obhiri chi obhiri afa.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Devid obhikhi agbong-nọng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Iwa ettem ebire epyibh Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi etzima etzor anọng p'Israẹl ọmaan pa Juda. Kw'osi iwa ọchọma Devid otzima ẹkhọr otzor bẹ, oben bi, “Rọhng atza atzọkha ọnọng-mik kw'Israẹl ọmaana kwa Juda.”<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Mẹ wọ, ọvaarnọng oben Joab ọmaana adenho p'agbong-nọng p'awobh ttar-ẹ bi, “Bọng nọhng makhọra nnọmma s'Israẹl, bọng ttẹwọr ka Dan maa, apyiri ka Beershẹba, abhik ajinọng ifha kaam mfha nnonga obhik kwabẹ.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Mando kwa Joab obhin ọvaarnọng bi, “Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwọ ọttara ọnọng-mik kw'agbong-nọng igbe arọbh azen ayongi-oyongi. Tte itta ọvaarnọng kwaam otzima chen pẹ ore kwẹ. Osi yan itta ọvaarnọng kwaam oben bi, osi odik-dema nwa o?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Wa atzim p'ọvaarnọng agaangi ayọhnga pa Joab ọmaana adenho mba pa agbong-nọng. Mando kwa bẹ abin aji ọvaarnọng, atza abhik agbong-nọng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Mada bẹ akk'Jọrdan ajekha, bẹ abhing abaanga Aroẹ, k'ẹrakha-ẹrakha kw'obhon kw'owobh k'ẹttẹri. Bẹ arenga ka Gad achina ka Jaza. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Bẹ arenga achina ka Gilead ọmaana k'ẹkhọma cha Tatim Hodshi, achina ka Dan Jaan, akhọri achina ka Sidon. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Bẹ an-arenga achina k'ichubhabe sa Taya, ọmaana k'ibhon sa abaHiv ttara sa abaKenaan biphyir. Bẹ an-akponga nnam achina ka Beershẹba kw'owobh ka Nẹgẹv k'ẹkhọma cha Juda.<verse eid="2SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Mada bẹ akk'arenga akpaanga irerek nna biphyir, bẹ akpa nnam ka Jẹrusalẹm k'okpong kw'aphe ọhawani ọmaana iwu ẹrọbh.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Iwa Joab ọgbaak ọvaarnọng ọnọng-mik kw'agbong-nọng: Wa ọnọng-mik kw'afanọng p'Israẹl ode, nnọhna arọbh azen p'afha abọkha ọkkangkkaang. Ọnọng-mik kwa Juda ode nnọhna arọbh attaan obhiri arọbh afa obhiri jobh.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Mada iwa Devid, okk'ẹnọng-mikha ch'agbong-nọng okyera, achibhi ayakh-ẹ atzim maa, on-oben Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bi, “Kaam nkk'ẹkhọhngkwuri ch'ideden nsa k'odik nwa kwa nsi. Tzotzokhaan, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, bina anang oponga-pyibha kwa kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwọ. Kaam nkk'odidingi-dik nsa e.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Yina Devid ọphyọbha k'ekpebha, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'Gad kw'ode ọsẹjaakhi, obiro ode ore-ka-chen-anna kwa Devid, atzim ọgbaakha, oben bi: <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Rọhng atza agbaak Devid bi, ‘Ma wọ ode odik kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọgbaakhi: Kaam njọ-ọ achibhi attaan k'itzitzikha bi, atzekha wani kwa kaam ńdima mkpaara aponga pọ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Mando kwa Gad ọtza okhebha Devid, oben-ẹ bi, “Ma na ọdaakh-ọ bi okwo f'ideden owobha k'irerek sọ, ka cho attaan o? Na obiro ọdaakh-ọ bi, arọbh abharkpa p'attattaanga-nọng pọ akhubh bọng k'aphe attaan o? Na obiro ọdaakh-ọ bi, ọkhọhmana f'ideden otto okhebha irerek nna k'iwu ittaan o? Kọ nang ochibhi m'idik nna, ifha agbaakh-m ochibhi kwa nda mgbaak ọnọng kw'ọtzọhm-m.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Iwa Devid oben Gad bi, “Kaam ettem ẹyakh-m atzim. Tte motzer ọkhaama ottotto k'itzitzikha s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'inọngkwo sẹ ibar-ọbar, ottu kw'ámotto ka mbọhk s'anọng ọkhaam e.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Mando kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọtzọhmi itzama s'ideden k'Israẹl, s'ittẹwọr k'ekpebha maa opyiri k'ogbe kwa bẹ akhe. Wa anọng nnọhna arọbh azenattaan obhiri chi, ape, ttẹwọr ka Dan maa apyiri Beershẹba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Mada orenga-eden kw'Ibinọkpaabyi onemi ọbọhk bi, odimi Jẹrusalẹm, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obhona ochibhi kwẹ kw'ọmmamma nwa. On-oben orenga-eden kwẹ bi, “Dọk kàsi! Tọr ọbọhk kwọ.” Wa orenga-eden nwa kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi on-owobh k'ibe sa bẹ am-awobha agwuma abọkpa-mọma s'Arawuna kw'ofon Jẹbus.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Mada Devid ore orenga-eden nwa kw'om-ofhu anọng, oben Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bi, “Kaam nkk'ẹkhọhngkwuri nsa e; Kaam, okkeri-ayok, nkk'epina nsa e. Bẹ-bẹ ade mach'arukhimaan e. Bẹ ọttọhk kasi. Tte ettuma chọ ewobha ẹnang kaam, ọmaana ẹhọhmmọr chaam.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devid osi ijafọhnibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />M'ewu nduma, Gad ọtza okhebha Devid oben-ẹ bi, “Rọhng avura atza asi ijafọhnibe anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, k'ibe sa bẹ am-awobha agwuma abọkpa-mọma s'Arawuna kw'ofon Jẹbus.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Mando kwa Devid ovur mach'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okk'orenga ka Gad ọtzọhn-ẹ. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />K'ogbe kw'Arawuna on-okkeri, ore da ọvaarnọng ọmaana akhaan-nọng pẹ am-arenga atzor-ẹ, oyin k'iyaan ọtza ọrakha ottima k'itzitzikha k'irerek, m'itzitzikha s'ọvaarnọng.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Arawuna ọbọbh bi, “Ode yan kw'itta ọvaarnọng kwaam, orori kaam ọtzọhmnọng kwẹ o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Devid obhina bi, “Kaam nkwu bi nkwu ndebh ibe sọ sa bẹ am-awobha agwuma abọkpa-mọma, ifha nsi ijafọhnibe mẹ nnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi e, k'odem kw'itzama s'itto ikhebha anọng mba ikwọhbha e.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Arawuna oben Devid bi, “Tte itta ọvaarnọng kwaam ọtzọkha ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'ọdaakh-ẹ, otzima osi ẹnanga e. Kkeri abhaam p'ẹnanga ẹkwọmichẹ ma, ọmaana atzekpa pa bẹ am-atzima agwuma abọkpa-mọma, ttara ayak p'abhaam p'atzima mach'ommen. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />K'ẹvaar chọ, kaam Arawuna ndọk ekpo mbya biphyir nnang ọvaarnọng. Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwọ, ọtzọkha ẹjafọhni chọ.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Yina, ọvaarnọng obhina Arawuna bi, “Mma e, kaam ngaam bi ndebh ekpo mbya k'agbukha e. Kaam ẹjafọhni ẹkwọmichẹ, ch'eni kaam ọttọhk epe, kínsi nnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwaam.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Mẹ wọ, Devid odebh ibe nna sa bẹ am-awobha agwuma abọkpa-mọma, ọmaana abhaam k'ashẹkẹl pa silva arọbh afa obhiri jobh. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Wa Devid osi ijafọhnibe mẹ ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Osi ẹjafọhni ẹkwọmichẹ ọmaana ẹnanga ch'odidiri mẹ. Mẹ wọ e, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obhina njọhm sẹ s'irerek nnuma. Mando kw'itzama s'itto ikhebha anọng p'Israẹl ibiri ikwọhbha.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>